#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"By using different spectral bands in the different colour channels (RGB) of "
"an image, certain\n"
"features can be emphasised in the data.\n"
"\n"
"Popular RGB composites are True Colour (red, blue and green\n"
"bands) or False Colour (near-infrared, red and green bands).\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](${ link1 }) or [here](${ link2 })."
msgstr ""
"Z uporabo različnih spektralnih kanalov v različnih barvnih kanalih (RGB) "
"slike je mogoče poudariti\n"
"določene značilnosti v podatkih.\n"
"\n"
"Priljubljeni kompoziti RGB so True Colour (prava barva, rdeča, modra in "
"zelena barva)\n"
"kanali) ali False Colour (umetna barva, bližnji infrardeči, rdeči in zeleni "
"kanali).\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij [tukaj](${ link1 }) ali [tukaj](${ link2 })."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Create a simple band ratio (A/B) to highlight the spectral differences "
"between two bands,\n"
"or create a normalized difference index ((A-B)/(A+B)) to compare your data "
"across time.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Popular difference indices are the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index "
"(NDVI),\n"
"which uses the near-infrared and red bands or the Normalized Difference "
"Water Index (NDWI),\n"
"which uses the near-infrared and shortwave infrared bands.\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](${ link1 }) or [here](${ link2 })."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite preprosto razmerje kanalov (A/B), da poudarite spektralne razlike "
"med dvema kanaloma,\n"
"ali pa ustvarite normaliziran indeks razlike ((A-B)/(A+B)) za primerjavo "
"podatkov v času.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Priljubljeni indeksi razlike so normalizirani indeks razlike vegetacije "
"(NDVI),\n"
"ki uporablja bližnje infrardeče in rdeče kanale, ali normalizirani indeks "
"razlike vode (NDWI),\n"
"ki uporablja bližnje infrardeče in kratkovalovne infrardeče kanale.\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij [tukaj](${ link1 }) ali [tukaj](${ link2 })."

msgid "Red"
msgstr "Rdeča"

msgid "Green"
msgstr "Zelena"

msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Modra"

msgid ""
"# Topographic Visualization\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This script returns a visualisation with green colours representing lowland "
"elevations and earth colours as mountainous elevations. The script uses "
"discrete classes rather than the continuous visualisations in the other DEM "
"layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to set custom min and max values in the evalscript by "
"setting defaultVis to false and setting the min and max variables to the "
"desired values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-topographic/)"
msgstr ""
"# Topografska vizualizacija\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ta skripta vrne vizualizacijo z zelenimi barvami, ki predstavljajo nižinske "
"vzpetine, in zemeljskimi barvami, ki predstavljajo gorske vzpetine. Skripta "
"uporablja diskretne razrede namesto zveznih vizualizacij v drugih slojih "
"DEM."

msgid ""
"# Color Visualization\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This script returns a color visualization of a digital elevation model, "
"assigning continuous colors to the elevation borders.\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to set custom min and max values in the evalscript by "
"setting defaultVis to false and setting the min and max variables to the "
"desired values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info [here.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-color/)"
msgstr ""
"# Vizualizacija barv\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ta skripta vrne barvno vizualizacijo digitalnega modela višin z uporabo "
"funkcije colorBlend, ki mejam višin pripisuje neprekinjene naravne barve "
"terena.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-color/)"

msgid ""
"# Grayscale Visualization\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This script returns a grayscale visualization of a digital elevation model, "
"assigning continuous colors to the elevation borders.\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to set custom min and max values in the evalscript by "
"setting defaultVis to false and setting the min and max variables to the "
"desired values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-grayscale/)"
msgstr ""
"# Vizualizacija v sivih lestvicah\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ta skripta vrne vizualizacijo digitalnega modela višin v sivih odtenkih z "
"uporabo funkcije colorBlend, ki dodeli neprekinjene barve mejam višin.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-grayscale/)"

msgid ""
"# Sepia Visualization\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This script returns a sepia visualization of a digital elevation model, "
"assigning continuous colors to the elevation borders.\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to set custom min and max values in the evalscript by "
"setting defaultVis to false and setting the min and max variables to the "
"desired values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info [here.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-sepia/)"
msgstr ""
"# Vizualizacija v sepiji\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ta skripta vrne sepijsko vizualizacijo digitalnega modela višin z uporabo "
"funkcije colorBlend, ki dodeljuje neprekinjene barve robovom višin.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-sepia/)"

