msgstr "Čas zaključka iz naraščajočega vozlišča"

msgid ""
"Determines whether the data was recorded during a descending orbit (flight "
"direction: north - south) or an ascending orbit (flight direction: south - "
"north)."
msgstr ""
"Določa, ali so bili podatki posneti med padajočo orbito (smer leta: sever - "
"jug) ali naraščajočo orbito (smer leta: jug - sever)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 to "
"the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending node "
"crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-1 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 12 days and 175 "
"orbits per cycle for a single satellite."
msgstr ""
"Relativno orbitalno število je število polnih orbit (med zaporednimi "
"prehodi naraščajočega vozlišča čez ekvator) od relativne orbite 1 do konca "
"cikla. Relativna orbita 1 je orbita, katere naraščajoče vozlišče prečka "
"ekvator najbližje poldnevniku v Greenwichu. Sentinel-1 je v skoraj polarni, "
"sončno-sinhroni orbiti s ciklom ponavljanja 12 dni in 175 obhodi na cikel "
"za en satelit."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-1 operates in 4 exclusive instrument acquisition modes. Depending "
"on the instrument mode, the data products may be available in different "
"polarisation, resolution and swath withs (between 20 km and 410 km). The "
"four different modes are:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM) \n"
"- Interferometric Wide swath (IW)\n"
"- Extra-Wide swath (EW)\n"
"- Wave (WV)"
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-1 deluje v štirih izključnih načinih pridobivanja podatkov. "
"Odvisno od načina instrumenta so lahko na voljo podatkovni izdelki z "
"različno polarizacijo, ločljivostjo in širino kanalu (med 20 km in 410 km). "
"Štirje različni načini so:\n"
"- Stripmap (SM)\n"
"- Interferometrični širok razpon (IW)\n"
"- Zelo širok kanal (EW)\n"
"- Valovni (WV)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the acquistion mode, the following swaths and identifiers are "
"possible:\n"
"- S1-S6 for SM mode (currently the only supported option)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 for IW mode\n"
"- EW1-EW5 for EW mode\n"
"- WV1-WV2 for WV mode"
msgstr ""
"Odvisno od načina pridobivanja so možni naslednji prelivi in "
"identifikatorji:\n"
"- S1-S6 za način SM (trenutno edina podprta možnost)\n"
"- IW1-IW3 za način IW\n"
"- EW1-EW5 za način EW\n"
"- WV1-WV2 za način WV"

msgid ""
"Determines with which polarisation the data was acquired. The first letter "
"indicates the polarisation when sending the signal, the second letter when "
"receiving the signal, e.g., HV = horizontal polarisation when sending the "
"signal and vertical polarisation when receiving.\n"
"\n"
"Data can be acquired in single polarisation HH (SH) or VV (SV) or in dual "
"polarisation HH&HV (DH) or VV&VH (DV), depending on the instrument mode.\n"
"\n"
"SM, IW and EW can be acquired in single or dual polarisation. WV can only "
"be acquired in single polarisation."
msgstr ""
"Določa, s katero polarizacijo so bili podatki pridobljeni. Prva črka "
"označuje polarizacijo pri pošiljanju signala, druga črka pa pri sprejemanju "
"signala, npr. HV = horizontalna polarizacija pri pošiljanju signala in "
"vertikalna polarizacija pri sprejemanju.\n"
"\n"
"Podatke je mogoče pridobiti v enojni polarizaciji HH (SH) ali VV (SV) ali v "
"dvojni polarizaciji HH&HV (DH) ali VV&VH (DV), odvisno od načina delovanja "
"instrumenta.\n"
"\n"
"Podatke SM, IW in EW je mogoče pridobiti v enojni ali dvojni polarizaciji. "
"WV je mogoče pridobiti samo v enopolarizacijskem načinu."

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-2 data includes products from the Sentinel-2 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-2A (operational since 2015) and "
"Sentinel-2B (operational since  2017)."
msgstr ""
"Razpoložljivi podatki Sentinel-2 vključujejo izdelke satelitske "
"konstelacije Sentinel-2, vključno s Sentinel-2A (deluje od leta 2015) in "
"Sentinel-2B (deluje od leta 2017)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between sucessive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-2 is in a "
"sun-synchronous orbit with a 10-day repeat cycle (5-days with both "
"satellites) and 143 orbits per cycle."
msgstr ""
"Relativno orbitalno število je število polnih orbit (med zaporednimi "
"prehodi naraščajočega vozlišča čez ekvator) od relativne orbite 1 do konca "
"cikla. Relativna orbita 1 je orbita, katere naraščajoče vozlišče prečka "
"ekvator najbližje poldnevniku v Greenwichu. Sentinel-2 je v sončno-sinhroni "
"orbiti z 10-dnevnim ponavljajočim se ciklom (5 dni z obema satelitoma) in "
"143 obhodi na cikel."

msgid ""
"Sentinel-3 data is  available in the following timeliness:\n"
"- Near Real Time (NRT):  typically available within 3 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Short Time Critical (STC): typically available within 48 hours after data "
"acquisition\n"
"- Non Time Critical (NTC): typically available within 1 months after data "
"acquisition"
msgstr ""
"Podatki Sentinel-3 so na voljo z naslednjimi časi dostave:\n"
"- Skoraj v realnem času (NRT): običajno so na voljo v 3 urah po pridobitvi "
"podatkov\n"
"- Kratkotrajni kritični čas (STC): običajno so na voljo v 48 urah po "
"pridobitvi podatkov\n"
"- Neaktualni (NTC): običajno so na voljo v 1 mesecu po pridobitvi podatkov"

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-3 data includes products from the Sentinel-3 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-3A (operational since 2016) and "
"Sentinel-3B (operational since 2018)."
msgstr ""
"Razpoložljivi podatki Sentinel-3 vključujejo izdelke iz konstelacije "
"satelitov Sentinel-3, vključno s Sentinel-3A (deluje od leta 2016) in "
"Sentinel-3B (deluje od leta 2018)."

msgid ""
"The Relative Orbit Number is the number of full orbits (between successive "
"ascending node crossings through the Equator) since the relative orbit 1 "
"until the end of a cycle. The relative orbit 1 is the orbit whose ascending "
"node crossing is closest to the Greenwich Meridian. Sentinel-3 is in a "
"near-polar, sun-synchronous orbit with a repeat cycle of 27 days."
msgstr ""
"Relativno orbitalno število je število polnih orbit (med zaporednimi "
"prehodi naraščajočega vozlišča čez ekvator) od relativne orbite 1 do konca "
"cikla. Relativna orbita 1 je orbita, katere naraščajoče vozlišče prečka "
"ekvator najbližje poldnevniku v Greenwichu. Sentinel-3 je v skoraj polarni, "
"sončno-sinhroni orbiti s ponavljajočim se ciklom 27 dni."

msgid ""
"The timeliness provides information about the delivery time of the data "
"product. For Sentinel-5P there are 3 different timeliness available:\n"
"- Near Real-Time (NRT): available within 3 hours of acquisition\n"
"- Offline: depending on the product, within 12 hours for Level 1B products\n"
"- Reprocessing: no time constraints (performed when major product upgrades "
"are required"
msgstr ""
"Čas dostave zagotavlja informacije o času dostave podatkovnega izdelka. Za "
"Sentinel-5P so na voljo trije časi:\n"
"- Skoraj v realnem času (NRT): na voljo v 3 urah po pridobitvi\n"
"- Brez povezave: odvisno od izdelka, v 12 urah za izdelke stopnje 1B\n"
"- Ponovna obdelava: brez časovnih omejitev (izvede se, kadar so potrebne "
"večje nadgradnje izdelka"

msgid ""
"The absolute Orbit Number is the number of orbits that have elapsed since "
"the first ascending node crossing after launch."
msgstr ""
"Absolutno orbitalno število je število orbit, ki so pretekle od prvega "
"prečkanja naraščajočega vozlišča po izstrelitvi."

