msgid ""
"Only applies for Level-1 GRD products and varies depending on the "
"acquisition mode:\n"
"- 3.5 m pixel spacing (full resolution: only SM mode) \n"
"- 10 m pixel spacing (high resolution: SW, IW mode)\n"
"- 25 m pixel spacing (high resolution: EW mode; medium resolution: WV mode)\n"
"- 40 m pixel spacing (medium resolution: SM, IW, EW mode)"
msgstr ""
"Velja samo za izdelke Level-1 GRD in je odvisno od načina zajema:\n"
"- razmik slikovnih pik 3,5 m (polna ločljivost: samo način SM) \n"
"- razmik slikovnih pik 10 m (visoka ločljivost: načina SW, IW)\n"
"- razmik slikovnih pik 25 m (visoka ločljivost: način EW; srednja "
"ločljivost: način WV)\n"
"- razmik slikovnih pik 40 m (srednja ločljivost: načini SM, IW, EW)"

msgid ""
"Depending on the processing level different product classes are available:\n"
"- Standard (S): all processing levels\n"
"- Calibration (C): Level-0 products \n"
"- Noise (N): Level-0 products\n"
"- Annotation (A): Level-1 and Level-2 products"
msgstr ""
"Glede na raven obdelave so na voljo različni razredi izdelkov:\n"
"- Standardni (S): vse ravni obdelave\n"
"- Kalibracijski (C): izdelki Level-0 \n"
"- Šumni (N): izdelki Level-0\n"
"- Z opombami (A): izdelki Level-1 in Level-2"

msgid ""
"GLO-30 and GLO-90 are free and open COP DEM datasets, offering global "
"coverage at resolutions of 30 and 90 m."
msgstr ""
"GLO-30 in GLO-90 sta brezplačni in odprti zbirki podatkov COP DEM, ki "
"ponujata globalno pokritost z ločljivostjo 30 in 90 m."

msgid ""
"EEA-10 is a COP DEM dataset available for eligible users only, offering "
"European coverage at resolution of 10 m."
msgstr ""
"EEA-10 je zbirka podatkov COP DEM, ki je na voljo samo upravičenim "
"uporabnikom in ponuja evropsko pokritost z ločljivostjo 10 m."

msgid ""
"#### Quick overview of Copernicus Browser features\n"
"\n"
"Copernicus Browser serves as a central hub for accessing, exploring and "
"utilising the wealth of Earth observation and environmental \n"
"data provided by the Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, "
"Sentinel-6, Copernicus Contributing Missions (Optical, SAR and DEM), \n"
"and Sentinel-1 and Sentinel-2 Global Mosaics (see details "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data.html)). You "
"simply \n"
"go to your area of interest, select data sources, time range and cloud "
"coverage, and inspect the resulting data.\n"
"\n"
"You can continue the tutorial by clicking on the \"Next\" button or you can "
"close it. By clicking the info \n"
"icon <span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> "
"in the top right \n"
"corner you can always resume the tutorial in case you closed it by mistake "
"or because you wanted to try something out."
msgstr ""
"#### Hiter pregled funkcij Copernicus Browserja\n"
"\n"
"Copernicus Browser je osrednje središče za dostop do podatkov o opazovanju "
"Zemlje in okolju ter za njihovo raziskovanje in uporabo. Podatke "
"zagotavljajo \n"
"Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Sentinel-3, Sentinel-5P, Sentinel-6, Copernicus "
"Contributing Missions (optične, SAR in DEM) \n"
"ter globalni mozaiki Sentinel-1 in Sentinel-2 (podrobnosti "
"[tukaj](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/Data.html)). "
"Preprosto \n"
"pojdite na svoje območje interesa, izberite vire podatkov, časovni obseg in "
"oblačnost ter si oglejte dobljene podatke.\n"
"\n"
"Vodič lahko nadaljujete s klikom na gumb »Naprej« ali ga zaprete. S klikom "
"na ikono z informacijami \n"
"<span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> v "
"zgornjem desnem \n"
"kotu lahko vodič vedno znova odprete, če ste ga zaprli pomotoma ali ker ste "
"želeli nekaj preizkusiti."

msgid ""
"Anonymous use of the Browser gives you access with limited functionality. "
"To be able to use all functions, you need a free account. \n"
"**Logged-in users** can use their custom themes, save and load pins, "
"measure distances, create a timelapse and use the extended image download."
msgstr ""
"Anonimna uporaba brskalnika omogoča dostop z omejeno funkcionalnostjo. Za "
"uporabo vseh funkcij potrebujete brezplačen račun. \n"
"**Prijavljeni uporabniki** lahko uporabljajo svoje teme po meri, "
"shranjujejo in nalagajo oznake, merijo razdalje, ustvarjajo časovno "
"zaporedje in uporabljajo razširjen prenos slik."

msgid ""
"Here you will find all visualisations that you added by clicking <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Add to</span> on \n"
"the layers under the Layers panel.\n"
"\n"
"There are two modes of comparing:\n"
"- **Opacity** (drag opacity slider left or right to fade between compared "
"images)\n"
"- **Split** (drag split slider left or right to set the boundary between "
"compared images)"
msgstr ""
"Tukaj boste našli vse prikaze, ki ste jih dodali s klikom na <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Dodaj v</span> pri \n"
"slojih na plošči Sloji.\n"
"\n"
"Primerjava je mogoča na dva načina:\n"
"- **Prosojnost** (povlecite drsnik prosojnosti levo ali desno za prehajanje "
"med primerjanima slikama)\n"
"- **Razdelitev** (povlecite drsnik razdelitve levo ali desno za določitev "
"meje med primerjanima slikama)"

msgid ""
"Search for a location either by scrolling the map with a mouse or by "
"entering the location in the **Go to Place** field."
msgstr ""
"Poiščite lokacijo s pomikanjem po karti z miško ali z vnosom lokacije v "
"polje **Pojdi na kraj**."

msgid ""
"Here you can select which base layer and overlays (borders, labels) are "
"shown on the map."
msgstr ""
"Tukaj lahko izberete, katera podlaga in prekrivni sloji (meje, oznake) so "
"prikazani na karti."

msgid ""
"You can view the tutorial anytime by clicking on this info icon <span "
"class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Vodič si lahko kadar koli ogledate s klikom na to ikono z informacijami "
"<span class=\"icon large-padding\"><i class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to draw a polygon on the map and display the polygon's "
"size.\n"
"\n"
"All layers that return a single value (such as NDVI, Moisture Index, NDWI, "
"...) support viewing the index\n"
"for the selected area over time. Clicking the chart icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span> will\n"
"display the statistical information charts (you need to be logged in to use "
"this option). You can remove the polygon \n"
"by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-close\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"You can also upload a KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) or GEOJSON/JSON file "
"with a polygon geometry using the\n"
"upload icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"The two sheets icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> lets you copy the polygon coordinates as a \n"
"GEOJSON and the crosshair <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centers the map on the drawn polygon."
msgstr ""
"To orodje omogoča risanje poligona na karti in prikaz velikosti poligona.\n"
"\n"
"Vsi sloji, ki vrnejo eno samo vrednost (kot so NDVI, indeks vlažnosti, "
"NDWI, ...), podpirajo ogled indeksa\n"
"za izbrano območje skozi čas. S klikom na ikono grafa <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span> se bodo\n"
"prikazali grafi statističnih informacij (za uporabo te možnosti morate biti "
"prijavljeni). Poligon lahko odstranite \n"
"s klikom na ikono za odstranitev <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-close\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Prav tako lahko naložite datoteko KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (v EPSG:4326) ali "
"GEOJSON/JSON z geometrijo poligona z ikono za\n"
"nalaganje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ikona z dvema listoma <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> omogoča kopiranje koordinat poligona kot \n"
"GEOJSON, nitni križ <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> pa središči karto na narisanem poligonu."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to draw a line on the map and display the line length.\n"
"\n"
"It also includes the **Elevation Profile**, a tool that allows you to "
"create the altitude profile by defining a line from point A to point B.\n"
"\n"
"You can also upload a KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (in EPSG:4326) or GEOJSON/JSON file "
"using the upload icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"The two sheets icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> lets you copy the line coordinates as a \n"
"GEOJSON and the crosshair <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> centers the map on the drawn line."
msgstr ""
"To orodje omogoča risanje črte na karti in prikaz dolžine črte.\n"
"\n"
"Vključuje tudi **višinski profil**, orodje, ki omogoča ustvarjanje "
"višinskega profila z določitvijo črte od točke A do točke B.\n"
"\n"
"Prav tako lahko naložite datoteko KML/KMZ, GPX, WKT (v EPSG:4326) ali "
"GEOJSON/JSON z ikono za nalaganje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-upload\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ikona z dvema listoma <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"far "
"fa-copy\"></i></span> omogoča kopiranje koordinat črte kot \n"
"GEOJSON, nitni križ <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> pa središči karto na narisani črti."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can mark a point on the map.\n"
"\n"
"You can also view statistical data for some layers by clicking on the chart "
"icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>. \n"
"You can remove the mark by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"S tem orodjem lahko označite točko na karti.\n"
"\n"
"Za nekatere sloje si lahko ogledate tudi statistične podatke s klikom na "
"ikono grafa <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-bar-chart\"></i></span>. \n"
"Oznako lahko odstranite s klikom na ikono za odstranitev <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can measure distances and areas on the map.\n"
"\n"
"Every mouse click creates a new point on the path. To stop adding points, "
"press the <code>Esc</code> key or double-click on the map.  \n"
"You can remove the measurement by clicking the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"S tem orodjem lahko merite razdalje in površine na karti.\n"
"\n"
"Vsak klik z miško ustvari novo točko na poti. Za prenehanje dodajanja točk "
"pritisnite tipko <code>Esc</code> ali dvokliknite na karti.  \n"
"Meritev lahko odstranite s klikom na ikono za odstranitev <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-close\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"With this tool (available to logged-in users), you can create a timelapse "
"animation of the visualised layer and displayed location.\n"
"\n"
"First, choose a time range. You can refine your search results further via "
"the **Filter by months** checkbox and/or by selecting one\n"
"image per defined period (orbit, day, week, month, year).\n"
"\n"
"Then press <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> "
"Search</span> and select your images. You can select all \n"
"by checking the checkbox or filter the images by cloud coverage by moving "
"the slider. Or you can pick images one by one by scrolling \n"
"through the list and selecting them. Via the **Borders** checkbox, you can "
"enable/disable the borders on your image.\n"
"\n"
"You can preview the timelapse by pressing the play button <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-play-circle\"></i></span>, set the speed "
"(frames per second)\n"
"and transition mode, all available at the bottom of the screen. See "
"additional settings by clicking the\n"
"settings icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"When you are satisfied with the result, click the download button and the "
"timelapse will be downloaded as a <code>.gif</code> or <code>.mp4</code> "
"file."
msgstr ""
"S tem orodjem (na voljo prijavljenim uporabnikom) lahko ustvarite časovno "
"animacijo prikazanega sloja in prikazane lokacije.\n"
"\n"
"Najprej izberite časovni obseg. Rezultate iskanja lahko dodatno zožite s "
"potrditvenim poljem **Filtriranje po mesecih** in/ali z izbiro ene\n"
"slike na določeno obdobje (orbita, dan, teden, mesec, leto).\n"
"\n"
"Nato pritisnite <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> "
"Iskanje</span> in izberite svoje slike. Vse slike lahko izberete \n"
"z označitvijo potrditvenega polja ali pa slike filtrirate glede na "
"oblačnost s premikanjem drsnika. Slike lahko izbirate tudi eno po eno s "
"pomikanjem \n"
"po seznamu in izbiranjem. S potrditvenim poljem **Meje** lahko "
"vklopite/izklopite meje na sliki.\n"
"\n"
"Predogled časovnega zaporedja si lahko ogledate s pritiskom na gumb za "
"predvajanje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-play-circle\"></i></span>, nastavite hitrost (sličice na sekundo)\n"
"in način prehoda, vse na dnu zaslona. Dodatne nastavitve so na voljo s "
"klikom na\n"
"ikono nastavitev <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-cogs\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Ko ste z rezultatom zadovoljni, kliknite gumb za prenos in časovno "
"zaporedje bo preneseno kot datoteka <code>.gif</code> ali <code>.mp4</code>."

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to navigate and fly through terrain effortlessly.\n"
"\n"
"You can make use of the 3D feature by utilising the following tools:\n"
"- Use **Vertical Terrain Scaling** to make flatter areas appear more "
"dynamic\n"
"- Simulate the Sun's movements and its projected shadows at any time of the "
"day\n"
"- Manipulate the **Shadow Parameters**\n"
"  - Shadow visibility\n"
"  - Shadow rendering distance\n"
"  - Shadow map size\n"
"- Control the ambient, diffuse and specular factors as well as specular "
"power\n"
"- Use the **Anaglyph Stereo Mode** to create two distinct red and blue "
"images to produce a single 3D stereo image"
msgstr ""
"To orodje omogoča preprosto navigacijo in letenje skozi teren.\n"
"\n"
"Funkcijo 3D lahko uporabljate z naslednjimi orodji:\n"
"- Uporabite **navpično merilo terena**, da bodo ravnejša območja videti "
"dinamičnejša\n"
"- Simulirajte gibanje sonca in njegove vržene sence ob poljubnem času dneva\n"
"- Upravljajte **parametre senc**\n"
"  - Vidnost senc\n"
"  - Razdalja izrisa senc\n"
"  - Velikost zemljevida senc\n"
"- Nadzirajte ambientne, difuzne in zrcalne faktorje ter zrcalno moč\n"
"- Uporabite **anaglifni stereo način** za ustvarjanje dveh ločenih rdečih "
"in modrih slik, ki tvorita eno samo stereo sliko 3D"

msgid ""
"This tool allows you to calculate and display statistical data (the "
"distribution of values) for specific layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is calculated for the data within your AOI (if defined) or otherwise for "
"the whole screen.\n"
"\n"
"You can hover over the bars in the histogram to read the values and "
"determine thresholds to distinguish between different spectral signatures.\n"
"\n"
"This tool currently only works for index layers (e.g. the NDVI)."
msgstr ""
"To orodje omogoča izračun in prikaz statističnih podatkov (porazdelitve "
"vrednosti) za določene sloje.\n"
"\n"
"Izračuna se za podatke znotraj vašega AOI (če je določen) ali sicer za "
"celoten zaslon.\n"
"\n"
"S premikanjem miške nad stolpce v histogramu lahko preberete vrednosti in "
"določite pragove za razlikovanje med različnimi spektralnimi podpisi.\n"
"\n"
"To orodje trenutno deluje samo za indeksne sloje (npr. NDVI)."

msgid ""
"You have reached the end of the tutorial. If you have any other questions, "
"feel free to ask us on \n"
"[our forum](https://forum.dataspace.copernicus.eu/) or [submit a "
