msgid ""
"NDVI, or Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, is a dimensionless index "
"that is indicative for vegetation density and is calculated by comparing "
"the visible and near-infrared sunlight reflected by the surface "
"(reflectance). The Global Land NDVI Collection 300m product is a 10-day "
"synthesis product derived from Top of Canopy PROBA-V 300m data."
msgstr ""
"NDVI ali normalizirani diferenčni vegetacijski indeks je brezdimenzijski "
"indeks, ki kaže gostoto vegetacije in se izračuna s primerjavo vidne in "
"bližnje infrardeče sončne svetlobe, ki jo odbije površje (odbojnost). "
"Izdelek Global Land NDVI Collection 300m je 10-dnevni sintezni izdelek, "
"izpeljan iz podatkov PROBA-V 300m na vrhu krošenj."

msgid ""
"SSM (Surface Soil Moisture) describes soil moisture of the soil’s topmost "
"5cm on a 1km (1°/112) spatial sampling. It is derived from microwave radar "
"data observed by the Sentinel-1 SAR satellite sensors."
msgstr ""
"SSM (vlažnost površinskih tal) opisuje vlažnost zgornjih 5 cm tal pri "
"prostorskem vzorčenju 1 km (1°/112). Izpeljana je iz mikrovalovnih "
"radarskih podatkov, ki jih opazujejo senzorji SAR satelita Sentinel-1."

msgid ""
"Land Surface Temperature (LST) is estimated from Top-of-Atmosphere (TOA) "
"brightness\n"
"temperatures of atmospheric window channels within the infrared range. LST "
"describes processes such as the exchange of energy and water between the "
"land surface and atmosphere, and influences the rate and timing of plant "
"growth."
msgstr ""
"Temperatura zemeljskega površja (LST) se ocenjuje iz sevalnih temperatur na "
"vrhu atmosfere (TOA)\n"
"v kanalih atmosferskega okna v infrardečem območju. LST opisuje procese, "
"kot sta izmenjava energije in vode med zemeljskim površjem in atmosfero, "
"ter vpliva na hitrost in čas rasti rastlin."

msgid ""
"This product is a 10-daily synthesis product derived from Top of Canopy "
"(TOC) PROVA-V 333 m data. The basic Water Bodies (WB) layer which tells "
"which pixels contain water and which not, defined as permanent and seasonal "
"water bodies, natural and man-made, independently of their size. Include "
"but are not restricted to the lakes of the Global terrestrial Network for "
"lakes."
msgstr ""
"Ta izdelek je 10-dnevni sintezni izdelek, izpeljan iz podatkov PROBA-V 333 "
"m na vrhu krošenj (TOC). Osnovni sloj vodnih teles (WB) pove, katere "
"slikovne pike vsebujejo vodo in katere ne; opredeljen je kot stalna in "
"sezonska vodna telesa, naravna in umetna, ne glede na njihovo velikost. "
"Vključuje jezera globalnega terestričnega omrežja za jezera, vendar ni "
"omejen nanje."

msgid ""
"Snow Water Equivalent (SWE) is the measure of the amount of water frozen "
"within the snow pack per unit area. In principle, it gives the height of "
"the water column that would form, if the snow pack would melt completely. "
"It is measured and indicated in millimetres [mm]. The retrieval algorithm "
"used here combines information from satellite-based microwave radiometer "
"and optical spectrometer observations with ground based weather station "
"snow depth measurements and produces daily hemispherical scale SWE "
"estimates. "
msgstr ""
"Vodni ekvivalent snega (SWE) je merilo količine vode, zamrznjene v snežni "
"odeji na enoto površine. Načeloma podaja višino vodnega stolpca, ki bi "
"nastal, če bi se snežna odeja popolnoma stopila. Meri se in izraža v "
"milimetrih [mm]. Uporabljeni algoritem pridobivanja združuje informacije iz "
"satelitskih opazovanj mikrovalovnega radiometra in optičnega spektrometra z "
"meritvami višine snega na prizemnih vremenskih postajah ter ustvarja dnevne "
"ocene SWE na hemisferni ravni. "

msgid ""
"The Snow Cover Extent (SCE) product provides information on the Fraction of "
"Snow Cover (FSC) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%). The SCE is derived "
"from medium resolution optical satellite data. The dataset has the "
"following classes: Outside area of interest (0), Water bodies (20), Cloud "
"mask (30), Polar night (251), Input data error (254), No data (255), and "
"Snow Cover Extent (values between 100 and 200, where the percentage of snow "
"cover can be derived using the formula: SCE = value – 100)."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek obsega snežne odeje (SCE) podaja informacije o deležu snežne odeje "
"(FSC) na slikovno piko v odstotkih (0 % – 100 %). SCE je izpeljan iz "
"optičnih satelitskih podatkov srednje ločljivosti. Nabor podatkov ima "
"naslednje razrede: zunaj območja interesa (0), vodna telesa (20), maska "
"oblakov (30), polarna noč (251), napaka vhodnih podatkov (254), ni podatkov "
"(255) in obseg snežne odeje (vrednosti med 100 in 200, pri čemer je "
"odstotek snežne odeje mogoče izpeljati s formulo: SCE = vrednost – 100)."

msgid ""
"The main Water Bodies detection layer (WB) uses the following values: Sea "
"(0), Water (70), No data (251), No water (255). From the Sentinel-2 L1C "
"input reflectances, Water Bodies are detected using the Modified Normalized "
"Difference Water Index (MNDWI), for each input tile"
msgstr ""
"Glavni sloj zaznavanja vodnih teles (WB) uporablja naslednje vrednosti: "
"morje (0), voda (70), ni podatkov (251), ni vode (255). Iz vhodnih "
"odbojnosti Sentinel-2 L1C se vodna telesa za vsako vhodno ploščico zaznajo "
"z uporabo spremenjenega normaliziranega diferenčnega vodnega indeksa (MNDWI)"

msgid ""
"The LIE variable is a classification of lake ice state, with the following "
"classes: Ice cover (10), Open water (30), Cloud (40). Some specific flag "
"values are used: Not interpreted / no satellite input data (50), Sea pixel "
"(60), Land pixel (70)."
msgstr ""
"Spremenljivka LIE je klasifikacija stanja ledu na jezerih z naslednjimi "
"razredi: ledena odeja (10), odprta voda (30), oblak (40). Uporabljene so "
"nekatere posebne vrednosti zastavic: ni interpretirano / ni vhodnih "
"satelitskih podatkov (50), morska slikovna pika (60), kopenska slikovna "
"pika (70)."

msgid ""
"The LIE variable is a classification of lake ice state, with the following "
"classes: Fully snow covered ice (1), Partially snow covered or  snow free "
"ice (2), Open water (3). Some specific flag values are also used for LIE: 0 "
"for missing data, 4 for sea pixels, 5 for cloudy pixels, 6 for land area. "
"LIE 250m uses thresholds on Top-of-Atmosphere (TOA) reflectances for full "
"snow cover, partially snow covered ice/clear ice, and open water."
msgstr ""
"Spremenljivka LIE je klasifikacija stanja ledu na jezerih z naslednjimi "
"razredi: led, popolnoma prekrit s snegom (1), led, delno prekrit s snegom "
"ali brez snega (2), odprta voda (3). Za LIE se uporabljajo tudi nekatere "
"posebne vrednosti zastavic: 0 za manjkajoče podatke, 4 za morske slikovne "
"pike, 5 za oblačne slikovne pike, 6 za kopensko območje. LIE 250m uporablja "
"pragove odbojnosti na vrhu atmosfere (TOA) za popolno snežno odejo, delno s "
"snegom prekrit led/čist led in odprto vodo."

msgid "WB 100m Monthly V1"
msgstr "WB 100m Monthly V1"

msgid "Name of the data collection or series."
msgstr "Ime zbirke ali serije podatkov."

msgid "Estimated percentage of cloud coverage in the scene."
msgstr "Ocenjeni odstotek oblačnosti na prizoru."

msgid "Short name of the instrument used to capture the data (e.g., SAR, MSI)."
msgstr "Kratko ime instrumenta, uporabljenega za zajem podatkov (npr. SAR, MSI)."

msgid "Identifier of the dataset within a collection."
msgstr "Identifikator zbirke podatkov znotraj zbirke."

msgid "Full name or path of the dataset."
msgstr "Polno ime ali pot zbirke podatkov."

msgid "Type of product generated, indicating processing level and acquisition mode."
msgstr "Vrsta ustvarjenega izdelka, ki označuje raven obdelave in način zajema."

msgid "Start time of the satellite sensing or data acquisition."
msgstr "Začetni čas satelitskega zaznavanja ali zajema podatkov."

msgid "Unique name or identifier of the product."
msgstr "Enolično ime ali identifikator izdelka."

msgid "Short name of the satellite platform (e.g., SENTINEL-1, SENTINEL-2)."
msgstr "Kratko ime satelitske platforme (npr. SENTINEL-1, SENTINEL-2)."

msgid "Identifier for the platform variant (e.g., A or B for Sentinel satellites)."
msgstr "Identifikator različice platforme (npr. A ali B za satelite Sentinel)."

msgid "Orbit number relative to a fixed reference cycle."
msgstr "Številka orbite glede na fiksni referenčni cikel."

msgid "Processing timeliness category (e.g., Near Real-Time, Offline)."
msgstr "Kategorija pravočasnosti obdelave (npr. Near Real-Time, Offline)."

msgid ""
"Direction of the satellite orbit during acquisition (e.g., ASCENDING, "
"DESCENDING)."
msgstr "Smer satelitske orbite med zajemom (npr. ASCENDING, DESCENDING)."

msgid "Acquisition mode used by the instrument (e.g., IW, SM)."
msgstr "Način zajema, ki ga uporablja instrument (npr. IW, SM)."

msgid "Radar polarisation modes used (e.g., VV, VH)."
msgstr "Uporabljeni načini radarske polarizacije (npr. VV, VH)."

msgid "Absolute orbit number at time of acquisition."
msgstr "Absolutna številka orbite ob zajemu."

msgid "Mode used for processing the product, if applicable."
msgstr "Način, uporabljen za obdelavo izdelka, če je primerno."

msgid "Identifiers of the swath(s) used in the acquisition (e.g., IW1, IW2, IW3)."
msgstr ""
"Identifikatorji pasov snemanja, uporabljenih pri zajemu (npr. IW1, IW2, "
"IW3)."

msgid "Indicates whether the product is currently available for download."
msgstr "Označuje, ali je izdelek trenutno na voljo za prenos."

msgid "Source organization or system that produced the data."
msgstr "Izvorna organizacija ali sistem, ki je ustvaril podatke."

msgid "Version of the processing software used to generate the product."
msgstr "Različica programske opreme za obdelavo, uporabljene za ustvarjanje izdelka."

msgid "Identifier for Sentinel-2 collection (e.g., S2_MSI_L1C)."
msgstr "Identifikator zbirke Sentinel-2 (npr. S2_MSI_L1C)."

msgid "Class of the product, indicating type or access constraints."
msgstr "Razred izdelka, ki označuje vrsto ali omejitve dostopa."

msgid "Spatial resolution of the dataset in meters."
msgstr "Prostorska ločljivost zbirke podatkov v metrih."

msgid "Identifier conforming to Earth Observation Product standards."
msgstr "Identifikator, skladen s standardi izdelkov za opazovanje Zemlje."

msgid "Incidence angle across the track of the satellite, typically in degrees."
msgstr "Vpadni kot prečno na sled satelita, običajno v stopinjah."

msgid "Classification of the resolution level (e.g., High, Medium)."
msgstr "Klasifikacija ravni ločljivosti (npr. visoka, srednja)."

msgid "Identifier for the delivery package or transfer bundle."
msgstr "Identifikator dobavnega paketa ali prenosnega svežnja."

msgid "Full name of the satellite platform."
msgstr "Polno ime satelitske platforme."

msgid "Identifier of the spatial grid cell containing the product."
msgstr "Identifikator celice prostorske mreže, ki vsebuje izdelek."

msgid "Time interval between repeat acquisitions over the same location."
msgstr "Časovni interval med ponovnimi zajemi nad isto lokacijo."

msgid "Version number of the dataset definition."
msgstr "Številka različice definicije zbirke podatkov."

msgid "File format used for the data product (e.g., SAFE, GeoTIFF)."
msgstr "Format datoteke, uporabljen za podatkovni izdelek (npr. SAFE, GeoTIFF)."

msgid "Geographic area the data product covers or is relevant to."
msgstr ""
"Geografsko območje, ki ga podatkovni izdelek pokriva ali za katerega je "
"pomemben."

msgid "Globally unique identifier for the dataset."
msgstr "Globalno enoličen identifikator zbirke podatkov."

msgid "Subsystem or data component involved in the acquisition or processing."
msgstr "Podsistem ali podatkovna komponenta, vključena v zajem ali obdelavo."

msgid "Human-readable label for the grid cell or tile."
msgstr "Človeku berljiva oznaka celice ali ploščice mreže."

msgid "Spacing of the grid in meters used for spatial referencing."
msgstr "Razmik mreže v metrih, uporabljen za prostorsko referenciranje."

msgid "Short, human-friendly name of the dataset."
msgstr "Kratko, človeku prijazno ime zbirke podatkov."

msgid "Time period over which data is consolidated for processing or delivery."
msgstr "Časovno obdobje, v katerem se podatki konsolidirajo za obdelavo ali dobavo."

msgid ""
"The reference date for the data, often representing when it is intended to "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"Referenčni datum za podatke, ki pogosto predstavlja čas, ko naj bi se "
"uporabljali."

msgid ""
"Fraction of valid LST values (used to calculate statistics) in the "
"compositing period. In this context, a valid LST value corresponds to a "
"clear-sky retrieval, after outlier removal."
msgstr ""
"Delež veljavnih vrednosti LST (uporabljenih za izračun statistike) v "
"kompozitnem obdobju. V tem kontekstu veljavna vrednost LST ustreza "
"pridobitvi pri jasnem nebu po odstranitvi osamelcev."

msgid ""
"The aim of 10-day Land Surface Temperature (LST) product is to provide a "
"complete overview of the LST daily cycle over each 10-day compositing for "
"every image pixel. This layer represents the maximum LST values retrieved "
"during the 10-days composite period."
msgstr ""
"Cilj 10-dnevnega izdelka temperature zemeljskega površja (LST) je "
"zagotoviti popolen pregled dnevnega cikla LST za vsako 10-dnevno kompozitno "
"obdobje za vsako slikovno piko. Ta sloj predstavlja največje vrednosti LST, "
"pridobljene v 10-dnevnem kompozitnem obdobju."

msgid ""
"The aim of 10-day Land Surface Temperature (LST) product is to provide a "
"complete overview of the LST daily cycle over each 10-day compositing for "
"every image pixel. This layer represents the median LST values retrieved "
"during the 10-days composite period."
msgstr ""
"Cilj 10-dnevnega izdelka temperature zemeljskega površja (LST) je "
"zagotoviti popolen pregled dnevnega cikla LST za vsako 10-dnevno kompozitno "
"obdobje za vsako slikovno piko. Ta sloj predstavlja mediane vrednosti LST, "
"pridobljene v 10-dnevnem kompozitnem obdobju."

msgid ""
"The aim of 10-day Land Surface Temperature (LST) product is to provide a "
"complete overview of the LST daily cycle over each 10-day compositing for "
"every image pixel. This layer represents the minimum LST values retrieved "
"during the 10-days composite period."
msgstr ""
"Cilj 10-dnevnega izdelka temperature zemeljskega površja (LST) je "
"zagotoviti popolen pregled dnevnega cikla LST za vsako 10-dnevno kompozitno "
"obdobje za vsako slikovno piko. Ta sloj predstavlja najmanjše vrednosti "
"LST, pridobljene v 10-dnevnem kompozitnem obdobju."

