msgid ""
"Mean turbidity, which is a key indicator of water clarity, quantifying the "
"haziness of the water and acting as an indicator of underwater light "
"availability. Here TMEAN is derived from total suspended matter (TSM) "
"estimates."
msgstr ""
"Povprečna motnost, ki je ključni kazalnik bistrosti vode, saj kvantificira "
"kalnost vode in služi kot kazalnik razpoložljivosti podvodne svetlobe. "
"Tukaj je TMEAN izpeljan iz ocen skupne suspendirane snovi (TSM)."

msgid ""
"Trophic State Index, referring to the degree at which organic matter "
"accumulates in the water body and is most commonly used in relation to "
"monitoring eutrophication. Here TSI is derived from phytoplankton biomass "
"by proxy of chlorophyll-a."
msgstr ""
"Indeks trofičnega stanja, ki se nanaša na stopnjo kopičenja organske snovi "
"v vodnem telesu in se najpogosteje uporablja pri spremljanju evtrofikacije. "
"Tukaj je TSI izpeljan iz biomase fitoplanktona prek klorofila-a."

msgid ""
"Total suspended matter (TSM) in g/m³, used to quantify the concentration of "
"suspended particles in the water body."
msgstr ""
"Skupna suspendirana snov (TSM) v g/m³, ki se uporablja za kvantifikacijo "
"koncentracije suspendiranih delcev v vodnem telesu."

