msgid ""
"# Thermal band 10\n"
"\n"
"This thermal visualization is based on band 10 (a band is a region of the "
"electromagnetic spectrum; a satellite sensor can image Earth in different "
"bands). At the central wavelength of 10895 nm it measures in the thermal "
"infrared, or TIR. Instead of measuring the temperature of the air, like "
"weather stations do, band 10 reports on the ground itself, which is often "
"much hotter. Thermal band 10 is useful in providing surface temperatures "
"and is collected with a 100-meter resolution.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://www.usgs.gov/faqs/what-are-band-designations-landsat-"
"satellites?qt-news_science_products=0#qt-news_science_products)."
msgstr ""
"# Termalni kanal 10\n"
"\n"
"Ta termalna vizualizacija temelji na kanalu 10 (kanal je območje "
"elektromagnetnega spektra; satelitski senzor lahko Zemljo posname v "
"različnih kanalih). Pri osrednji valovni dolžini 10895 nm meri v termalnem "
"infrardečem območju (TIR). Namesto temperature zraka, kot to počnejo "
"vremenske postaje, kanal 10 poroča o samih tleh, ki so pogosto precej bolj "
"vroča. Termalni kanal 10 je uporaben za pridobivanje površinskih temperatur "
"in se zajema z ločljivostjo 100 metrov.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://www.usgs.gov/faqs/what-are-band-designations-landsat-"
"satellites?qt-news_science_products=0#qt-news_science_products)."

msgid ""
"# True color composite\n"
"\n"
"Sensors carried by satellites can image Earth in different regions of the "
"electromagnetic spectrum. Each region in the spectrum is referred to as a "
"band. Landsat 8-9 has 11 bands. True color composite uses visible light "
"bands red, green and blue in the corresponding red, green and blue color "
"channels, resulting in a natural colored product, that is a good "
"representation of the Earth as humans would see it naturally.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/landsat-8/composites/)."
msgstr ""
"# Kompozit v pravih barvah\n"
"\n"
"Senzorji na satelitih lahko Zemljo posnamejo v različnih območjih "
"elektromagnetnega spektra. Vsako območje spektra imenujemo kanal. Landsat "
"8-9 ima 11 kanalov. Kompozit v pravih barvah uporablja kanale vidne "
"svetlobe, rdečega, zelenega in modrega, v ustreznih rdečem, zelenem in "
"modrem barvnem kanalu, kar daje naravno obarvan izdelek, ki dobro "
"predstavlja Zemljo, kot bi jo ljudje videli naravno.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/landsat-8/composites/)."

msgid ""
"# Pansharpened True Color\n"
"\n"
"The pansharpened true color composite is done by using the usual true color "
"data (red, green and blue (RGB)) and enhancing them by using the "
"panchromatic band 8, or pan band (a band is a region of the electromagnetic "
"spectrum; a satellite sensor can image Earth in different bands). An image "
"from the pan band is similar to black-and-white film: it combines light "
"from the red, green, and blue parts of the spectrum into a single measure "
"of overall visible reflectance. Pansharpened images have 4x the resolution "
"of the usual true color composite, greatly enhancing the usefulness of "
"Landsat imagery.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://blog.mapbox.com/pansharpening-for-higher-resolution-in-"
"landsat-live-e4717cd7c356)."
msgstr ""
"# Poostrene prave barve (pansharpened)\n"
"\n"
"Kompozit v poostrenih pravih barvah nastane z uporabo običajnih podatkov v "
"pravih barvah (rdeča, zelena in modra (RGB)), ki jih izboljšamo s "
"pankromatskim kanalom 8 oziroma pan kanalom (kanal je območje "
"elektromagnetnega spektra; satelitski senzor lahko Zemljo posname v "
"različnih kanalih). Posnetek iz pan kanala je podoben črno-belemu filmu: "
"združuje svetlobo iz rdečega, zelenega in modrega dela spektra v eno samo "
"mero celotne vidne odbojnosti. Poostreni posnetki imajo 4-krat večjo "
"ločljivost kot običajni kompozit v pravih barvah, kar močno poveča "
"uporabnost posnetkov Landsat.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://blog.mapbox.com/pansharpening-for-higher-resolution-in-"
"landsat-live-e4717cd7c356)."

msgid ""
"# Normalised Difference Snow Index (NDSI)\n"
"\n"
"The normalised difference snow index (NDSI) can be used to differentiate "
"between cloud and snow cover as snow absorbs in the short-wave infrared "
"light, but reflects the visible light, whereas cloud is generally "
"reflective in both wavelengths. Snow cover is represented in bright vivid "
"blue.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info [here](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/sentinel-2/ndsi/)."
msgstr ""
"# Normaliziran diferenčni indeks snega (NDSI)\n"
"\n"
"Normaliziran diferenčni indeks snega (NDSI) se lahko uporablja za "
"razlikovanje med oblaki in snežno odejo, saj sneg vpija kratkovalovno "
"infrardečo svetlobo, vidno svetlobo pa odbija, oblaki pa so na splošno "
"odbojni v obeh valovnih dolžinah. Snežna odeja je prikazana v svetli živo "
"modri barvi.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/sentinel-2/ndsi/)."

msgid ""
"The **Landsat 8-9** collection contains imagery from the two most recently "
"launched Landsat satellites (Landsat 8 and Landsat 9, provided by "
"NASA/USGS). Both carry the Operational Land Imager (OLI) and the Thermal "
"Infrared Sensor (TIRS), with 9 optical and 2 thermal bands. These two "
"sensors provide seasonal coverage of the global landmass.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 15 m for the panchromatic band and 30 m for the "
"rest (the thermal bands are re-sampled from 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** 16 days\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since January 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Vegetation monitoring, land use, land cover maps, change "
"monitoring, etc.\n"
"\n"
"**Level-1** data (from **Landsat Collection 2**) provides global top of the "
"atmosphere reflectance and top of the atmosphere brightness temperature "
"products. \n"
"  \n"
"The data underwent several processing steps including geometric and "
"radiometric improvements. \n"
"  \n"
"More info about Level-1 data "
"[here](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."
msgstr ""
"Zbirka **Landsat 8-9** vsebuje posnetke dveh nazadnje izstreljenih "
"satelitov Landsat (Landsat 8 in Landsat 9, ki ju zagotavljata NASA/USGS). "
"Oba nosita optični senzor OLI (Operational Land Imager) in termalni "
"infrardeči senzor TIRS (Thermal Infrared Sensor) z 9 optičnimi in 2 "
"termalnima kanaloma. Ta dva senzorja zagotavljata sezonsko pokritost "
"globalnega kopnega.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorska ločljivost:** 15 m za pankromatski kanal in 30 m za ostale "
"(termalni kanali so prevzorčeni s 100 m).\n"
"\n"
"**Čas ponovnega obiska:** 16 dni\n"
"\n"
"**Razpoložljivost podatkov:** Od januarja 2021\n"
"\n"
"**Običajna uporaba:** Spremljanje vegetacije, raba tal, karte pokrovnosti "
"tal, spremljanje sprememb itd.\n"
"\n"
"Podatki **Level-1** (iz **Landsat Collection 2**) zagotavljajo globalne "
"izdelke odbojnosti na vrhu atmosfere in svetlostne temperature na vrhu "
"atmosfere. \n"
"  \n"
"Podatki so bili obdelani v več korakih, vključno z geometričnimi in "
"radiometričnimi izboljšavami. \n"
"  \n"
"Več informacij o podatkih Level-1 "
"[tukaj](https://documentation.dataspace.copernicus.eu/APIs/SentinelHub/Data/"
"Landsat8-9.html)."

msgid "NDVI 300m 10-daily V3"
msgstr "NDVI 300m 10-daily V3"

msgid ""
"Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI) is an indicator of the "
"greenness of the biomes. Every 10-days estimates are available at global "
"scale in the spatial resolution of about 300 m from 2014 to June 2020. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalized-"
"difference-vegetation-index-300m-v1.0)."
msgstr ""
"Normaliziran diferenčni vegetacijski indeks (NDVI) je kazalnik zelenosti "
"biomov. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo približno 300 m od leta 2014 do junija 2020. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalized-"
"difference-vegetation-index-300m-v1.0)."

