msgstr ""
"RMSE je izračunan med končno dekadno vrednostjo FAPAR in razpoložljivimi "
"veljavnimi trenutnimi vrednostmi v oknu sestavljanja."

msgid ""
"Provides information about Leaf Area Index, defined as half the total area "
"of green elements of the canopy per unit horizontal ground area. Every "
"10-days estimates are available at global scale in the spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2-"
"0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o indeksu listne površine, definiranem kot polovica "
"skupne površine zelenih elementov krošnje na enoto vodoravne talne "
"površine. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~300 m od januarja 2014 do danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/leaf-area-index-v2"
"-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Quantifies the fraction of the solar radiation absorbed by live plants for "
"photosynthesis. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, in "
"the spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Kvantificira delež sončnega sevanja, ki ga žive rastline vpijejo za "
"fotosintezo. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~300 m od januarja 2014 do danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/fraction-of-"
"absorbed-photosynthetically-active-radiation-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"FCOVER is defined as the fraction of ground surface covered by green "
"vegetation as seen from the nadir direction."
msgstr ""
"FCOVER je definiran kot delež talne površine, ki jo prekriva zelena "
"vegetacija, gledano iz smeri nadirja."

msgid ""
"RMSE is computed between the final dekadal FCOVER value and the available "
"valid instantaneous values in the compositing window."
msgstr ""
"RMSE je izračunan med končno dekadno vrednostjo FCOVER in razpoložljivimi "
"veljavnimi trenutnimi vrednostmi v oknu sestavljanja."

