msgid ""
"The Snow Cover Extent (SCE) product is generated daily in near-real time "
"for the global land areas, excluding Antarctica, based on medium resolution "
"optical satellite data. The snow maps are generated from Sentinel-3 SLSTR "
"data and in parallel from NOAA-20 VIIRS data to assure service continuity "
"in case one satellite or sensor fails. The global SCE product provides "
"information on the Fraction of Snow Cover (FSC) on ground (also in forested "
"areas) per pixel in percentage (0% – 100%) and is extending from 90°N/180°W "
"to 90°S/180°E with a pixel size of 0.01° x 0.01° (approx. 1 km x 1 km). The "
"product is provided within 1 day after the last raw image acquisition per "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek Snow Cover Extent (SCE) se ustvarja dnevno skoraj v realnem času za "
"globalna kopenska območja, razen Antarktike, na podlagi optičnih "
"satelitskih podatkov srednje ločljivosti. Snežni zemljevidi se ustvarjajo "
"iz podatkov Sentinel-3 SLSTR in vzporedno iz podatkov NOAA-20 VIIRS, da se "
"zagotovi neprekinjenost storitve v primeru odpovedi enega satelita ali "
"senzorja. Globalni izdelek SCE zagotavlja informacije o deležu snežne odeje "
"(FSC) na tleh (tudi v gozdnatih območjih) na piksel v odstotkih (0 % – 100 "
"%) in sega od 90°N/180°W do 90°S/180°E z velikostjo piksla 0,01° x 0,01° "
"(približno 1 km x 1 km). Izdelek je na voljo v 1 dnevu po zadnjem zajemu "
"surovega posnetka za posamezen datum."

msgid "Snow Cover Extent Uncertainty, provided as unbiased Root Mean Square Error"
msgstr ""
"Negotovost obsega snežne odeje, podana kot nepristranska kvadratna sredina "
"napake (RMSE)"

msgid ""
"Provides for global land areas (excluding Antarctica) daily maps of the "
"fraction of snow cover on ground (also in forested areas) per pixel in "
"percentage (0% – 100%). The data is available in near real time with a "
"pixel spacing of about 1 km and with the temporal extent from December 2025 "
"to present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja dnevne zemljevide deleža snežne odeje na tleh (tudi v gozdnatih "
"območjih) na piksel v odstotkih (0 % – 100 %) za globalna kopenska območja "
"(razen Antarktike). Podatki so na voljo skoraj v realnem času z razmikom "
"pikslov približno 1 km za obdobje od decembra 2025 do danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/snow/snow-cover-global-v1-0-1"
"km)."

