msgid ""
"Dry Matter Productivity is defined as the overall growth rate, or dry "
"biomass increase, of the vegetation. It is expressed in kg of Dry Matter "
"per hectare and per day (kg DM/ha/day)."
msgstr ""
"Produktivnost suhe snovi je definirana kot celotna stopnja rasti oziroma "
"prirastek suhe biomase vegetacije. Izražena je v kg suhe snovi na hektar na "
"dan (kg DM/ha/dan)."

msgid ""
"GPP is defined as the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day."
msgstr ""
"GPP je definiran kot skupna količina ogljikovih spojin, ki jih v danem "
"časovnem obdobju s fotosintezo proizvedejo rastline v ekosistemu, izražena "
"v gC/m²/dan."

msgid ""
"NPP is defined as the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced by plants "
"per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day."
msgstr ""
"NPP je definiran kot neto količina biomase oziroma ogljika, ki jo rastline "
"proizvedejo na enoto površine in časa, izražena v gC/m²/dan."

msgid ""
"GDMP represents the total amount of dry matter produced by land plants per "
"unit time through photosynthesis. It is expressed in kg of Dry Matter per "
"hectare and per day (kg DM/ha/day)."
msgstr ""
"GDMP predstavlja skupno količino suhe snovi, ki jo kopenske rastline "
"proizvedejo na enoto časa s fotosintezo. Izražen je v kg suhe snovi na "
"hektar na dan (kg DM/ha/dan)."

