msgid ""
"Provides information about the overall growth rate, or net dry biomass "
"increase, of the vegetation. It is equivalent to Net Primary Production "
"(NPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and per day. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o celotni stopnji rasti oziroma neto prirastku suhe "
"biomase vegetacije. Je enakovreden neto primarni produkciji (NPP), vendar "
"izražen v kg suhe snovi na hektar na dan. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v "
"globalnem merilu s prostorsko ločljivostjo ~300 m od januarja 2014 do "
"danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of carbon compounds produced by "
"photosynthesis of plants in an ecosystem in a given period of time, "
"expressed in gC/m²/day. Every 10-days, estimates are available at global "
"scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o skupni količini ogljikovih spojin, ki jih v danem "
"časovnem obdobju s fotosintezo proizvedejo rastline v ekosistemu, izražene "
"v gC/m²/dan. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~300 m od januarja 2014 do danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the net amount of biomass, or carbon, produced "
"by plants per unit area and time, expressed in gC/m²/day. It is equal to "
"the difference between the Gross Primary Production (GPP), i.e. the total "
"amount of carbon produced through photosynthesis, and the amount of energy "
"used for plant respiration. Every 10-days, estimates are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the "
"present. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o neto količini biomase oziroma ogljika, ki jo "
"rastline proizvedejo na enoto površine in časa, izraženi v gC/m²/dan. Enaka "
"je razliki med bruto primarno produkcijo (GPP), tj. skupno količino "
"ogljika, proizvedenega s fotosintezo, in količino energije, porabljene za "
"dihanje rastlin. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v globalnem merilu s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo ~300 m od januarja 2014 do danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/net-primary-"
"production-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information about the total amount of dry matter produced by land "
"plants per unit time through photosynthesis. It is equivalent to Gross "
"Primary Production (GPP) but expressed in kg of dry matter per hectare and "
"per day. Every 10-days estimates are available at global scale, at a "
"spatial resolution of ~ 300 m, from January 2014 to the present. More "
"information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o skupni količini suhe snovi, ki jo kopenske "
"rastline proizvedejo na enoto časa s fotosintezo. Je enakovredna bruto "
"primarni produkciji (GPP), vendar izražena v kg suhe snovi na hektar na "
"dan. Desetdnevne ocene so na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~300 m od januarja 2014 do danes. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/gross-dry-matter-"
"productivity-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"ends in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The end-of-season "
"occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value reaches 15% of "
"the season amplitude during the green-down period. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 1: podaja dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije "
"rastlin konča vegetacijska rastna sezona. Konec sezone nastopi po "
"definiciji, ko vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin med obdobjem pojemanja "
"zelenja doseže 15 % amplitude sezone. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"ends in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The end-of-season "
"occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value reaches 15% of "
"the season amplitude during the green-down period. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 2: podaja dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije "
"rastlin konča vegetacijska rastna sezona. Konec sezone nastopi po "
"definiciji, ko vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin med obdobjem pojemanja "
"zelenja doseže 15 % amplitude sezone. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the day of the year in the vegetation growing season "
"when the maximum Plant Phenology Index value is reached. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 1: podaja dan v letu v vegetacijski rastni sezoni, ko je dosežena "
"največja vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin. Podatki so na voljo s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the day of the year in the vegetation growing season "
"when the maximum Plant Phenology Index value is reached. The data are "
"available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to "
"present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 2: podaja dan v letu v vegetacijski rastni sezoni, ko je dosežena "
"največja vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin. Podatki so na voljo s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 1: provides the average Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on "
"left and right sides of each season. The data are available at 300 m "
"spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 1: podaja povprečno vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin v minimumih "
"na levi in desni strani posamezne sezone. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 2: provides the average Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on "
"left and right sides of each season. The data are available at 300 m "
"spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 2: podaja povprečno vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin v minimumih "
"na levi in desni strani posamezne sezone. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 1: the growing season integral that is computed as the "
"time-integrated Plant Phenology Index values between the dates of the "
"season start and end, minus their base level value. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 1: integral rastne sezone, izračunan kot časovno integrirane "
"vrednosti indeksa fenologije rastlin med datumoma začetka in konca sezone, "
"zmanjšan za vrednost osnovne ravni. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 2: the growing season integral that is computed as the "
"time-integrated Plant Phenology Index values between the dates of the "
"season start and end, minus their base level value. The data are available "
"at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 2: integral rastne sezone, izračunan kot časovno integrirane "
"vrednosti indeksa fenologije rastlin med datumoma začetka in konca sezone, "
"zmanjšan za vrednost osnovne ravni. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 1: marks the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"starts in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The "
"start-of-season occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value "
"reaches 25% of the season amplitude during the green-up period. The data "
"are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from "
"2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 1: označuje dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije "
"rastlin začne vegetacijska rastna sezona. Začetek sezone nastopi po "
"definiciji, ko vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin med obdobjem naraščanja "
"zelenja doseže 25 % amplitude sezone. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 2: marks the day of the year when the vegetation growing season "
"starts in the time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. The "
"start-of-season occurs, by definition, when the Plant Phenology Index value "
"reaches 25% of the season amplitude during the green-up period. The data "
"are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent from "
"2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 2: označuje dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije "
"rastlin začne vegetacijska rastna sezona. Začetek sezone nastopi po "
"definiciji, ko vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin med obdobjem naraščanja "
"zelenja doseže 25 % amplitude sezone. Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 1: the growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant "
"Phenology Index values between the dates of the season start and end. The "
"data are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent "
"from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 1: integral rastne sezone, izračunan kot časovno integrirane "
"vrednosti indeksa fenologije rastlin med datumoma začetka in konca sezone. "
"Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 "
"do danes."

msgid ""
"Season 2: the growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant "
"Phenology Index values between the dates of the season start and end. The "
"data are available at 300 m spatial resolution with the temporal extent "
"from 2023 to present."
msgstr ""
"Sezona 2: integral rastne sezone, izračunan kot časovno integrirane "
"vrednosti indeksa fenologije rastlin med datumoma začetka in konca sezone. "
"Podatki so na voljo s prostorsko ločljivostjo 300 m za obdobje od leta 2023 "
"do danes."

