"Izražen je v [m².dan/m²]."

msgid ""
"Growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant Phenology "
"Index values between the dates of the start and end of the first growing "
"season minus their base level value. Expressed in [m².day/m²]."
msgstr ""
"Integral rastne sezone, izračunan kot časovno integrirane vrednosti indeksa "
"fenologije rastlin med datumoma začetka in konca prve rastne sezone, "
"zmanjšan za vrednost osnovne ravni. Izražen je v [m².dan/m²]."

msgid ""
"Growing season integral computed as the time-integrated Plant Phenology "
"Index values between the dates of the start and end of the second growing "
"season minus their base level value. Expressed in [m².day/m²]."
msgstr ""
"Integral rastne sezone, izračunan kot časovno integrirane vrednosti indeksa "
"fenologije rastlin med datumoma začetka in konca druge rastne sezone, "
"zmanjšan za vrednost osnovne ravni. Izražen je v [m².dan/m²]."

msgid "Number of days between the start and the end of the first growing season."
msgstr "Število dni med začetkom in koncem prve rastne sezone."

msgid "Number of days between the start and the end of the second growing season."
msgstr "Število dni med začetkom in koncem druge rastne sezone."

msgid ""
"Difference between the Season Maximum value and the Season Minimum Value "
"for the first growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Razlika med največjo in najmanjšo vrednostjo sezone za prvo rastno sezono. "
"Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Difference between the Season Maximum value and the Season Minimum Value "
"for the second growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Razlika med največjo in najmanjšo vrednostjo sezone za drugo rastno sezono. "
"Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Absolute value of the decreasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the "
"first season vegetation green-down. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]."
msgstr ""
"Absolutna vrednost stopnje padanja indeksa fenologije rastlin med "
"pojemanjem zelenja vegetacije v prvi sezoni. Izražena je v [m² / m² /dan]."

msgid ""
"Absolute value of the decreasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the "
"second season vegetation green-down. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]."
msgstr ""
"Absolutna vrednost stopnje padanja indeksa fenologije rastlin med "
"pojemanjem zelenja vegetacije v drugi sezoni. Izražena je v [m² / m² /dan]."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the first vegetation growing season starts in the time "
"profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A negative value of the SOSD "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"start of the season is located in the previous year."
msgstr ""
"Dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije rastlin začne prva "
"vegetacijska rastna sezona. Negativna vrednost SOSD pomeni, da je vrh "
"rastne sezone v tekočem letu, začetek sezone pa v preteklem letu."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the second vegetation growing season starts in the "
"time profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A negative value of the SOSD "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"start of the season is located in the previous year."
msgstr ""
"Dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije rastlin začne druga "
"vegetacijska rastna sezona. Negativna vrednost SOSD pomeni, da je vrh "
"rastne sezone v tekočem letu, začetek sezone pa v preteklem letu."

msgid ""
"Day of the year in the first vegetation growing season when the Plant "
"Phenology Index reaches its maximum value."
msgstr ""
"Dan v letu v prvi vegetacijski rastni sezoni, ko indeks fenologije rastlin "
"doseže največjo vrednost."

msgid ""
"Day of the year in the second vegetation growing season when the Plant "
"Phenology Index reaches its maximum value."
msgstr ""
"Dan v letu v drugi vegetacijski rastni sezoni, ko indeks fenologije rastlin "
"doseže največjo vrednost."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the first vegetation growing season ends in the time "
"profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A value of the EOSD larger than 365 "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"end of the season is located in the next year."
msgstr ""
"Dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije rastlin konča prva "
"vegetacijska rastna sezona. Vrednost EOSD, večja od 365, pomeni, da je vrh "
"rastne sezone v tekočem letu, konec sezone pa v naslednjem letu."

msgid ""
"Day of the year when the second vegetation growing season ends in the time "
"profile of the Plant Phenology Index. A value of the EOSD larger than 365 "
"indicates that the peak of growing season is in the current year and the "
"end of the season is located in the next year."
msgstr ""
"Dan v letu, ko se v časovnem profilu indeksa fenologije rastlin konča druga "
"vegetacijska rastna sezona. Vrednost EOSD, večja od 365, pomeni, da je vrh "
"rastne sezone v tekočem letu, konec sezone pa v naslednjem letu."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the start of the first vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin na začetku prve vegetacijske rastne "
"sezone. Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the start of the second vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin na začetku druge vegetacijske rastne "
"sezone. Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Maximum value that the Plant Phenology Index reaches during the first "
"vegetation growing season i.e. value of the Plant Phenology Index at the "
"maximum season date of the first growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Največja vrednost, ki jo indeks fenologije rastlin doseže med prvo "
"vegetacijsko rastno sezono, tj. vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin na "
"datum sezonskega maksimuma prve rastne sezone. Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Maximum value that the Plant Phenology Index reaches during the second "
"vegetation growing season i.e. value of the Plant Phenology Index at the "
"maximum season date of the second growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Največja vrednost, ki jo indeks fenologije rastlin doseže med drugo "
"vegetacijsko rastno sezono, tj. vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin na "
"datum sezonskega maksimuma druge rastne sezone. Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"The average of the Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on left and "
"right sides of the first season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Povprečje vrednosti indeksa fenologije rastlin v minimumih na levi in desni "
"strani prve sezone. Izraženo je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"The average of the Plant Phenology Index value of the minima on left and "
"right sides of the second season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Povprečje vrednosti indeksa fenologije rastlin v minimumih na levi in desni "
"strani druge sezone. Izraženo je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the end of the first vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin na koncu prve vegetacijske rastne "
"sezone. Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the Plant Phenology Index at the end of the second vegetation "
"growing season. Expressed in [m² / m²]."
msgstr ""
"Vrednost indeksa fenologije rastlin na koncu druge vegetacijske rastne "
"sezone. Izražena je v [m² / m²]."

msgid ""
"Value of the increasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the first "
"season vegetation green-up. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]"
msgstr ""
"Vrednost stopnje naraščanja indeksa fenologije rastlin med naraščanjem "
"zelenja vegetacije v prvi sezoni. Izražena je v [m² / m² /dan]"

msgid ""
"Value of the increasing rate of Plant Phenology Index during the second "
"season vegetation green-up. Expressed in [m² / m² /day]."
msgstr ""
"Vrednost stopnje naraščanja indeksa fenologije rastlin med naraščanjem "
"zelenja vegetacije v drugi sezoni. Izražena je v [m² / m² /dan]."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level a classification of the presence of fallow "
"land over annual cropland area at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of "
"0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja klasifikacijo prisotnosti prahe na njivskih površinah na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for fallow land presence."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za prisotnost prahe."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m "
"information on the dominant leaf type (broadleaved or coniferous)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o prevladujočem tipu listov (listavci ali iglavci) "
"na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for dominant leaf type."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za prevladujoči tip listov."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level a classification of cropland into one of the "
"19 crop type classes at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja klasifikacijo njivskih površin v enega od 19 razredov vrst "
"posevkov na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for crop types."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za vrste posevkov."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the duration of the main growing season at a "
"spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja trajanje glavne rastne sezone na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for main crop duration."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za trajanje glavnega posevka."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for tree cover presence change."
msgstr ""
"Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za spremembo prisotnosti drevesnega "
"pokrova."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for grassland change."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za spremembo travinja."

msgid ""
"Classification of grassland / non-grassland. Provides at pan-European level "
"in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic land cover classification with "
"two thematic classes (grassland / non-grassland)."
msgstr ""
"Klasifikacija travinje / ne travinje. Zagotavlja osnovno klasifikacijo "
"pokrovnosti tal z dvema tematskima razredoma (travinje / ne travinje) na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for grassland classification."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za klasifikacijo travinja."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m the level "
"of tree cover density in a range from 0% to 100%."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja raven gostote drevesnega pokrova v razponu od 0 % do 100 % na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for tree cover density."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za gostoto drevesnega pokrova."

msgid "NPP 300m 10-daily V2"
msgstr "NPP 300m 10-daily V2"

msgid "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2"
msgstr "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2"

msgid "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT1"
msgstr "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT1"

msgid "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT2"
msgstr "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT2"

msgid "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT6"
msgstr "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT6"

msgid "CPFLP 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPFLP 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "DLT 10m Yearly (2018–present)"
msgstr "DLT 10m Yearly (2018–present)"

msgid "CTY 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CTY 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "CPMCD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPMCD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "GRA 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "GRA 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "TCD 10m Yearly (2018–present)"
msgstr "TCD 10m Yearly (2018–present)"

msgid "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT0"
msgstr "GDMP 300m 10-daily V2 RT0"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-tree "
"covered areas, broadleaved and coniferous).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Dominant Leaf Type (DLT) zagotavlja "
"osnovno klasifikacijo pokrovnosti tal s 3 tematskimi razredi (vsa območja "
"brez drevesnega pokrova, listavci in iglavci).\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2018 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko "
"podatkov je na voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Presence (CPFLP) "
"raster product provides the yearly fallow land classification indicating if "
"arable land has been left fallow in the respective calendar year. This "
"dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the "
"European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer "
"available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Presence (CPFLP) zagotavlja letno klasifikacijo prahe, ki kaže, ali je bila "
"obdelovalna zemlja v zadevnem koledarskem letu puščena v prahi. Ta zbirka "
"podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih ločljivosti 10 "
"metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v ploščicah 100 x 100 "
"km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38. Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je "
"del storitve Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. "
"Za zbirko podatkov je na voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) raster product provides high "
"resolution crop type classification for 17 classes of both arable and "
"permanent crops across the EEA38 extent. Using both Sentinel-1 and "
"Sentinel-2, the model is finetuned to first map the crop field boundaries, "
"and then determine the main crop for each field.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Crop Types (CTY) zagotavlja "
"klasifikacijo vrst posevkov visoke ločljivosti za 17 razredov njivskih in "
"trajnih posevkov na območju EEA38. Z uporabo podatkov Sentinel-1 in "
"Sentinel-2 je model fino nastavljen tako, da najprej kartira meje njiv, "
"nato pa za vsako njivo določi glavni posevek.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Duration (CPMCD) "
"raster product provides the duration (in days) of the growing season for "
"the main (annual) crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries. High Resolution Layer Croplands product is "
"part of the European Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence "
"layer available for the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Duration (CPMCD) zagotavlja trajanje (v dneh) rastne sezone glavnega "
"(enoletnega) posevka.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38. Izdelek High Resolution "
"Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega "
"površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) provides a forest "
"classification with 3 thematic classes (all non-forest areas / broadleaved "
"forest / coniferous forest) at 10m spatial resolution and with a Minimum "
"Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.5 ha. This raster layer is largely following the "
"FAO (Food and Agriculture Organisation of the United Nations) forest "
"definition with tree covered areas in agricultural and urban context "
"excluded using the respective Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)"
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) zagotavlja klasifikacijo gozdov s 3 "
"tematskimi razredi (vsa negozdna območja / listnati gozd / iglasti gozd) s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in najmanjšo kartirno enoto (MMU) 0,5 ha. Ta "
"rastrski sloj v veliki meri sledi definiciji gozda FAO (Organizacija "
"Združenih narodov za prehrano in kmetijstvo), pri čemer so območja z "
"drevesnim pokrovom v kmetijskem in urbanem okolju izključena z uporabo "
"ustreznega sloja Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL).\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo s triletno pogostostjo v rastrih ločljivosti "
"10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v ploščicah 100 x 100 "
"km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) zagotavlja binarni "
"statusni sloj maske travinje/ne travinje. Ta osnovni izdelek travnate in "
"neolesenele vegetacije vključuje vse vrste travinja: gospodarjeno travinje, "
"polnaravno travinje in naravno travnato vegetacijo. Ne vključuje začasnega "
"travinja, ki je izločeno z ustreznim indikatorjem oranja (PLOUGH), ki kaže "
"število let od zadnjega oranja piksla.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 10 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth’s surface\".\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for "
"the dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs)."
msgstr ""
"Zbirka podatkov High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) zagotavlja "
"informacije o sorazmerni pokritosti s krošnjami na piksel s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 10 metrov in sega od 0 % (vsa območja brez drevesnega pokrova) "
"do 100 %, pri čemer je gostota drevesnega pokrova definirana kot »navpična "
"projekcija krošenj dreves na vodoravno zemeljsko površje«.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2018 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko "
"podatkov je na voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM)."

msgid ""
"The available Sentinel-1 data includes products from the Sentinel-1 "
"satellite constellation, including Sentinel-1A (operational since 2014), "
"Sentinel-1B (operational from 2016 to 2022), Sentinel-1C (operational since "
"2025), Sentinel-1D (operational since 2026)."
msgstr ""
"Razpoložljivi podatki Sentinel-1 vključujejo izdelke konstelacije satelitov "
"Sentinel-1, vključno s Sentinel-1A (v uporabi od leta 2014), Sentinel-1B (v "
"uporabi od leta 2016 do 2022), Sentinel-1C (v uporabi od leta 2025) in "
"Sentinel-1D (v uporabi od leta 2026)."

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 is a 10 m high resolution raster "
"layer containing height information generated for selected cities and urban "
"areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 je rastrski sloj visoke ločljivosti "
"10 m z informacijami o višini, ustvarjen za izbrana mesta in urbana območja "
"v okviru nabora izdelkov Urban Atlas."

msgid "UA BBH 3-yearly 2021"
msgstr "UA BBH 3-yearly 2021"

msgid ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 is a 10 m high resolution raster "
"layer containing height information generated for selected cities and urban "
"areas as part of the Urban atlas suite of products. Height information is "
"based on satellite information and derived datasets like the digital "
"surface model, the digital terrain model and the normalized digital surface "
"model (DSM). More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."
msgstr ""
"Urban Atlas Building Block Height 2021 je rastrski sloj visoke ločljivosti "
"10 m z informacijami o višini, ustvarjen za izbrana mesta in urbana območja "
"v okviru nabora izdelkov Urban Atlas. Informacije o višini temeljijo na "
"satelitskih podatkih in izpeljanih zbirkah podatkov, kot so digitalni model "
"površja, digitalni model terena in normaliziran digitalni model površja "
"(DSM). Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/urban-atlas)."

msgid ""
"# Land Surface Temperature (LST)\n"
"\n"
"The Land Surface Temperature (LST) product provides the temperature of the "
"Earth's surface as retrieved from the SLSTR thermal infrared channels. LST "
"is a key parameter in the physics of land surface, controlling the "
"partitioning of energy between the atmosphere and the land surface. It is "
"used in climate change monitoring, drought monitoring, and urban heat "
"island studies.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/slstr-products#S3-SLSTR-Products-"
"L2-LST-Products)."
msgstr ""
"# Temperatura površja kopnega (LST)\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek temperature površja kopnega (LST) zagotavlja temperaturo "
"zemeljskega površja, pridobljeno iz termalnih infrardečih kanalov SLSTR. "
"LST je ključni parameter v fiziki kopenskega površja, saj nadzoruje "
"porazdelitev energije med atmosfero in kopnim. Uporablja se pri spremljanju "
"podnebnih sprememb, spremljanju suše in študijah urbanih toplotnih otokov.\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://sentiwiki.copernicus.eu/web/slstr-products#S3-SLSTR-"
"Products-L2-LST-Products)."

msgid ""
"# Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI)\n"
"\n"
"The Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI) is a dimensionless index "
"that describes the difference between visible and near-infrared reflectance "
"of vegetation cover. It can be used to estimate the density of vegetation "
"cover and monitor vegetation health.\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here](https://github.com/eu-cdse/sentinel-hub-custom-scripts/tree/main/"
"sentinel-3/slstrl2/ndvi/)."
msgstr ""
"# Normaliziran diferenčni vegetacijski indeks (NDVI)\n"
"\n"
"Normaliziran diferenčni vegetacijski indeks (NDVI) je brezdimenzijski "
"indeks, ki opisuje razliko med odbojnostjo vegetacijskega pokrova v vidnem "
"in bližnjem infrardečem delu spektra. Z njim lahko ocenimo gostoto "
"vegetacijskega pokrova in spremljamo zdravje vegetacije.\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://github.com/eu-cdse/sentinel-hub-custom-scripts/tree/main/"
"sentinel-3/slstrl2/ndvi/)."

msgid ""
"The **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** instrument on board "
"Sentinel-3 measures the global and regional sea and land surface "
"temperature. The SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) product provides "
"land surface temperature retrieved from the thermal infrared channels.\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial resolution:** 1km (that is, only details bigger than 1km can be "
"seen).\n"
"\n"
"**Revisit time:** Maximum 1 day to revisit the same area, using both "
"satellites.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** Since May 2018 onwards.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Climate change monitoring, land surface temperature "
"monitoring, drought monitoring, urban heat island studies."
msgstr ""
"Instrument **Sea and Land Surface Temperature (SLSTR)** na satelitu "
"Sentinel-3 meri globalno in regionalno temperaturo morskega in kopenskega "
"površja. Izdelek SLSTR L2 Land Surface Temperature (LST) zagotavlja "
"temperaturo kopenskega površja, pridobljeno iz termalnih infrardečih "
"kanalov.\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorska ločljivost:** 1 km (tj. vidne so le podrobnosti, večje od 1 "
"km).\n"
"\n"
"**Čas ponovnega obiska:** Največ 1 dan za ponovni obisk istega območja z "
"uporabo obeh satelitov.\n"
"\n"
"**Razpoložljivost podatkov:** Od maja 2018 naprej.\n"
"\n"
"**Običajna uporaba:** Spremljanje podnebnih sprememb, spremljanje "
"temperature kopenskega površja, spremljanje suše, študije urbanih toplotnih "
"otokov."

msgid "Land Surface Temperature, expressed in Kelvin."
msgstr "Temperatura zemeljskega površja, izražena v kelvinih."

msgid "LST 3km Hourly V3"
msgstr "LST 3km Hourly V3"

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja ocene temperature površja kopnega v globalnem merilu s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo ~3 km. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-"
"reflectance?tab=land_surface_temperature)."

msgid ""
"Minimum of Land Surface Temperature observed during the 10-days period, per "
"hour. Expressed in Kelvin."
msgstr ""
"Najnižja temperatura površja kopnega, opažena v 10-dnevnem obdobju, po "
"urah. Izražena v kelvinih."

msgid ""
"Median of Land Surface Temperature observed during the 10-days period, per "
"hour. Expressed in Kelvin."
msgstr ""
"Mediana temperature površja kopnega, opažene v 10-dnevnem obdobju, po urah. "
"Izražena v kelvinih."

msgid ""
"Maximum of Land Surface Temperature observed during the 10-days period, per "
"hour. Expressed in Kelvin."
msgstr ""
"Najvišja temperatura površja kopnega, opažena v 10-dnevnem obdobju, po "
"urah. Izražena v kelvinih."

msgid ""
"Fraction of valid observations as used to calculate the minimum, median and "
"maximum temperature values, per hour."
msgstr ""
"Delež veljavnih opazovanj, uporabljenih za izračun najnižje, mediane in "
"najvišje temperature, po urah."

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja ocene temperature površja kopnega v globalnem merilu s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo ~3 km. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid "LST Daily-cycle 3km 10-daily V3"
msgstr "LST Daily-cycle 3km 10-daily V3"

msgid ""
"Median of Land Surface Temperature observed during the 10-days period, "
"regardless the time of the day. Expressed in Kelvin."
msgstr ""
"Mediana temperature površja kopnega, opažene v 10-dnevnem obdobju, ne glede "
"na čas dneva. Izražena v kelvinih."

msgid ""
"Thermal Condition Index for the compositing period, estimated using LST "
"observations around local solar noon."
msgstr ""
"Indeks toplotnega stanja za obdobje sestavljanja, ocenjen na podlagi "
"opazovanj LST okoli lokalnega sončnega poldneva."

msgid ""
"Fraction of valid observations as used to calculate the minimum, median and "
"maximum temperature values, regardless the time of the day."
msgstr ""
"Delež veljavnih opazovanj, uporabljenih za izračun najnižje, mediane in "
"najvišje temperature, ne glede na čas dneva."

msgid "LST TCI 3km 10-daily V3"
msgstr "LST TCI 3km 10-daily V3"

msgid ""
"Provides Land Surface Temperature estimates at global scale, at a spatial "
"resolution of ~3 km. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/10"
"daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja ocene temperature površja kopnega v globalnem merilu s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo ~3 km. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/temperature-and-reflectance/1"
"0daily-land-surface-temperature-synthesis-global-v3-0-3km)."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m an "
"indication on the number of years since a ploughing event for each pixel in "
"the herbaceous cover. This dataset is auxiliary and is used in production "
"of the Grassland status products to distinguish between temporary and "
"permanent grasslands."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja kazalnik števila let od dogodka oranja za vsak piksel zelnatega "
"pokrova na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m. Ta zbirka "
"podatkov je pomožna in se uporablja pri izdelavi izdelkov stanja travinja "
"za razlikovanje med začasnim in trajnim travinjem."

msgid ""
"Count of grassland mowing events. Provides at pan-European level in the "
"spatial resolution of 10 m a basic land cover classification containing "
"respectively the number of grassland mowing events (GRAME) within the "
"detected temporal and permanent grassland (Herbaceous cover Layer) at a "
"spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Število dogodkov košnje travinja. Zagotavlja osnovno klasifikacijo "
"pokrovnosti tal na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m, ki "
"vsebuje število dogodkov košnje travinja (GRAME) znotraj zaznanega "
"začasnega in trajnega travinja (sloj zelnatega pokrova) s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for grassland mowing events."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za dogodke košnje travinja."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the type (4 categories) of the secondary "
"crop season at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja vrsto (4 kategorije) sekundarne rastne sezone posevka na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification containing respectively the grassland mowing "
"dates (GRAMD) within the detected temporal and permanent grassland "
"(Herbaceous cover Layer) at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 "
"ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja osnovno klasifikacijo pokrovnosti tal na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m, ki vsebuje datume košnje travinja (GRAMD) "
"znotraj zaznanega začasnega in trajnega travinja (sloj zelnatega pokrova) s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the annual crop type diversity over a "
"three-year period at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha. "
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja letno raznolikost vrst posevkov v triletnem obdobju na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha. "

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification with two thematic classes (herbaceous / "
"non-herbaceous)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja osnovno klasifikacijo pokrovnosti tal z dvema tematskima "
"razredoma (zelnato / nezelnato) na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 10 m."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the number (max 2) of growing seasons (main "
"and secondary) within a calendar year at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a "
"MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja število (največ 2) rastnih sezon (glavne in sekundarne) v "
"koledarskem letu na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU "
"0,25 ha."

msgid "PLOUGH 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "PLOUGH 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "GRAME 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "GRAME 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "CPSCT 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPSCT 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "GRAMD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "GRAMD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "CPCST 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPCST 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "HER 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "HER 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid "CPCSY 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPCSY 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) raster product "
"continues the 2015 and 2018 PLOUGH Layer following a rolling archive "
"principle by adding current information and removing historic years. It "
"indicates the number of years since the last indication of ploughing within "
"the permanent grassland area. PLOUGH is derived by taking into account the "
"series of binary HER layers, the BVL classifications and HR VPP PPI (Plant "
"Phenology Index) quantiles. BVL classes 4 (crop) and 7 (overlaying layer "
"between herbaceous and crop) indicate a ploughing event. Low HR VPP PPI "
"quantiles indicate low vegetation at a certain time of the year. For years "
"with missing information (2016 and earlier) the ploughing information from "
"the historic PLOUGH product is considered which causes some issues.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH) "
"nadaljuje sloj PLOUGH za leti 2015 in 2018 po načelu drsečega arhiva, tako "
"da dodaja trenutne informacije in odstranjuje pretekla leta. Kaže število "
"let od zadnjega znaka oranja znotraj območja trajnega travinja. PLOUGH je "
"izpeljan ob upoštevanju serije binarnih slojev HER, klasifikacij BVL in "
"kvantilov HR VPP PPI (indeks fenologije rastlin). Razreda BVL 4 (posevek) "
"in 7 (prekrivajoči sloj med zelnatim in posevkom) kažeta na dogodek oranja. "
"Nizki kvantili HR VPP PPI kažejo nizko vegetacijo v določenem času leta. Za "
"leta z manjkajočimi informacijami (2016 in prej) se upoštevajo informacije "
"o oranju iz zgodovinskega izdelka PLOUGH, kar povzroča nekatere težave.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Type (CPSCT) "
"raster product indicates if a cover crop was present within the respective "
"calendar year and further segregates the types of cover crop into: short "
"summer, long summer, short winter and long winter cover crop.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Type (CPSCT) kaže, ali je bil v zadevnem koledarskem letu prisoten pokrovni "
"posevek, in vrste pokrovnih posevkov dodatno razvršča v: kratek poletni, "
"dolg poletni, kratek zimski in dolg zimski pokrovni posevek.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) raster product "
"provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 10 m a basic "
"land cover classification, flagging and mapping the start date (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) within the detected Herbaceous cover layer (temporal and permanent "
"grassland)) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) of 0.25 ha. The GRAMD product "
"will flag and map the dates (Day of Year) of each mowing event on temporary "
"or permanent grassland per year, resulting in a product split in four "
"different rasters per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2017 in 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Dates (GRAMD) "
"zagotavlja osnovno klasifikacijo pokrovnosti tal na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m, ki označuje in kartira začetni datum (DOY) "
"(GRAMD) znotraj zaznanega sloja zelnatega pokrova (začasno in trajno "
"travinje) z najmanjšo kartirno enoto (MMU) 0,25 ha. Izdelek GRAMD označuje "
"in kartira datume (dan v letu) vsakega dogodka košnje na začasnem ali "
"trajnem travinju v posameznem letu, zato je izdelek razdeljen na štiri "
"različne rastre na leto.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Types "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides the number of different crop types grown in "
"a 3-year period [0-3] (excluding cover crops).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons "
"Types (CPCSY) zagotavlja število različnih vrst posevkov, gojenih v "
"triletnem obdobju [0-3] (brez pokrovnih posevkov).\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) raster product "
"provides a basic land cover classification containing respectively the "
"number of grassland mowing events within the detected Herbaceous cover "
"layer (temporal and permanent grassland) with a Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) "
"of 0.25 ha. The GRAME product will flag and map the number of mowing events "
"(1, 2, 3, or 4+) on temporary or permanent grassland detected per year.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Grassland Mowing Events (GRAME) "
"zagotavlja osnovno klasifikacijo pokrovnosti tal, ki vsebuje število "
"dogodkov košnje travinja znotraj zaznanega sloja zelnatega pokrova (začasno "
"in trajno travinje) z najmanjšo kartirno enoto (MMU) 0,25 ha. Izdelek GRAME "
"označuje in kartira število dogodkov košnje (1, 2, 3 ali 4+) na začasnem "
"ali trajnem travinju, zaznanih v posameznem letu.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) raster product provides a "
"basic land cover classification with 2 thematic classes (temporal and "
"permanent herbaceous / non-herbaceous). The production of the herbaceous "
"layer is primarily based on the probability estimates obtained from the "
"Base Vegetation Layer (BVL) which also serves to harmonize the different "
"vegetated HRL products (Grasslands, Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER "
"is further used as input for the Grassland status layer (GRA) extracting "
"the permanent herbaceous in combination with the Ploughing indicator "
"(PLOUGH).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Herbaceous cover (HER) zagotavlja "
"osnovno klasifikacijo pokrovnosti tal z 2 tematskima razredoma (začasni in "
"trajni zelnati / nezelnati). Izdelava zelnatega sloja temelji predvsem na "
"ocenah verjetnosti, pridobljenih iz sloja Base Vegetation Layer (BVL), ki "
"služi tudi usklajevanju različnih vegetacijskih izdelkov HRL (Grasslands, "
"Tree Cover and Forests, Croplands). HER se nadalje uporablja kot vhodni "
"podatek za sloj stanja travinja (GRA), pri čemer se v kombinaciji z "
"indikatorjem oranja (PLOUGH) izloči trajni zelnati pokrov.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons Yearly "
"(CPCSY) raster product provides number of growing seasons detected within 1 "
"year (0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Cropping Seasons "
"Yearly (CPCSY) zagotavlja število rastnih sezon, zaznanih v enem letu "
"(0/1/2).\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the duration of the bare soil period before "
"the start of the main growing season at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a "
"MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja trajanje obdobja golih tal pred začetkom glavne rastne sezone na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for bare soil before."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za gola tla pred posevkom."

msgid "CPBSB 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPBSB 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid ""
"Provides auxiliary information in the spatial resolution of 10 m on the "
"trees in agricultural use and urban context, used for production of the "
"Forest Type dataset for the 2021 reference year. Data is sourced from "
"Corine Land Cover and High Resolution Layer Imperviousness."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja pomožne informacije o drevesih v kmetijski rabi in urbanem "
"okolju s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m, ki se uporabljajo za izdelavo zbirke "
"podatkov Forest Type za referenčno leto 2021. Podatki izvirajo iz Corine "
"Land Cover in High Resolution Layer Imperviousness."

msgid "FADSL 10m 3-yearly (2018–2021)"
msgstr "FADSL 10m 3-yearly (2018–2021)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) provides "
"information on trees under agricultural use or in urban context to be "
"excluded from the Forest Type (FTY) product and at 10m spatial resolution. "
"The derivation of Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) is based on the "
"spatial intersection of the 10m DLT and TCD layers with CORINE Land Cover "
"(CLC) 2018 and HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 with 10 m spatial resolution; "
"TCD range of 10-100%; with a MMW of 10m and no MMU (pixel base).\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 10 meter rasters (fully "
"conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the "
"EEA38 countries.\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union’s Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"High Resolution Layer Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) zagotavlja "
"informacije o drevesih v kmetijski rabi ali v urbanem okolju, ki jih je "
"treba izključiti iz izdelka Forest Type (FTY), s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 "
"m. Izpeljava sloja Forest Additional Support Layer (FADSL) temelji na "
"prostorskem preseku slojev DLT in TCD ločljivosti 10 m s slojema CORINE "
"Land Cover (CLC) 2018 in HRL Imperviousness Degree 2018 s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 10 m; razpon TCD 10-100 %; z MMW 10 m in brez MMU (na ravni "
"piksla).\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo s triletno pogostostjo v rastrih ločljivosti "
"10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v ploščicah 100 x 100 "
"km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the duration of the secondary crop season at "
"a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja trajanje sekundarne rastne sezone posevka na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for secondary crops duration."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za trajanje sekundarnih posevkov."

msgid "CPSCD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPSCD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Duration "
"(CPSCD) raster product provides the duration (in days) of the cover crop "
"season (can exceed the calendar year).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Duration (CPSCD) zagotavlja trajanje (v dneh) sezone pokrovnega posevka "
"(lahko preseže koledarsko leto).\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the duration of the fallow land period over "
"a five-year period at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja trajanje obdobja prahe v petletnem obdobju na vseevropski ravni "
"s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for fallow land duration."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za trajanje prahe."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the emergence date of the secondary crop "
"season at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja datum vznika sekundarne rastne sezone posevka na vseevropski "
"ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "CPSCE 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPSCE 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop Emergence "
"(CPSCE) raster product provides the date of emergence of the cover crop in "
"days of the year (DOY). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year (e.g. 19 "
"for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Secondary Crop "
"Emergence (CPSCE) zagotavlja datum vznika pokrovnega posevka v dnevih v "
"letu (DOY). YYDOY, kjer je YY = zadnji dve števki leta (npr. 19 za 2019), "
"DOY pa je dan v letu (1-365)\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the duration of the bare soil period after "
"the harvest of the main annual crop at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a "
"MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja trajanje obdobja golih tal po žetvi glavnega enoletnega posevka "
"na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for bare soil after."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za gola tla po posevku."

msgid "CPBSA 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPBSA 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before (CPBSB) "
"raster product provides the bare soil period (in days) before the emergence "
"of the main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend "
"the calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil Before "
"(CPBSB) zagotavlja obdobje golih tal (v dneh) pred vznikom glavnega "
"enoletnega posevka. Upoštevajte, da obdobje golih tal ne more preseči "
"koledarskega leta, za katero je izdelek ustvarjen.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After (CPBSA) "
"raster product provides bare soil period (in days) after the harvest of the "
"main annual crop. Note that the bare soil period cannot transcend the "
"calendar year for which the product is generated.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Bare Soil After "
"(CPBSA) zagotavlja obdobje golih tal (v dneh) po žetvi glavnega enoletnega "
"posevka. Upoštevajte, da obdobje golih tal ne more preseči koledarskega "
"leta, za katero je izdelek ustvarjen.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

