#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-2 Quarterly Mosaics** product offers an almost cloud-free "
"image over the entire globe, created by stitching together the cloudless "
"Sentinel-2 images acquired over a quarterly period (every 3 months) at a "
"spatial resolution of 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Global Coverage.\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Data for each quarter is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding quarter (e.g. 1.1. or 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** 10 meters.\n"
"\n"
"**Common usage:** Creating Basemaps, Land cover classification, "
"Infrastructure/Land use planning, Environmental monitoring, Water resource "
"management and more."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek **Sentinel-2 Quarterly Mosaics** ponuja skoraj brezoblačen posnetek "
"celotnega sveta, ustvarjen s spajanjem brezoblačnih posnetkov Sentinel-2, "
"zajetih v četrtletnem obdobju (vsake 3 mesece), s prostorsko ločljivostjo "
"10 metrov.\n"
"\n"
"**Pokritost:** Globalna pokritost.\n"
"\n"
"**Razpoložljivost podatkov:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podatki za posamezno četrtletje so v katalogu na voljo na 1. dan ustreznega "
"četrtletja (npr. 1.1. ali 1.4.).\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorska ločljivost:** 10 metrov.\n"
"\n"
"**Običajna uporaba:** Izdelava podlag za karte, klasifikacija pokrovnosti "
"tal, načrtovanje infrastrukture/rabe tal, spremljanje okolja, upravljanje "
"vodnih virov in drugo."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics are scenes with DH "
"polarization and can come from all acquisition modes.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Primarily polar and near-polar areas, as well as "
"ocean-relevant areas\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~40 meters."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek **Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics** je mesečni kompozit, pridobljen z "
"izračunom povprečja vhodnih prizorov, radiometrično in geometrično "
"popravljenih glede na teren, ki je tehtano z lokalno ločljivostjo. Ker "
"uporablja vse razpoložljive podatke v mesecu, vsebuje manj šuma »speckle« "
"(časovno povprečje) in najboljšo možno lokalno ločljivost (kombinacija "
"naraščajočih in padajočih orbit).\n"
"\n"
"Vhodni podatki za Sentinel-1 DH Monthly Mosaics so prizori s polarizacijo "
"DH in lahko izvirajo iz vseh načinov zajema.\n"
"\n"
"**Pokritost:** Predvsem polarna in skoraj polarna območja ter območja, "
"pomembna za oceane\n"
"\n"
"**Razpoložljivost podatkov:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podatki za posamezen mesec so v katalogu na voljo na 1. dan ustreznega "
"meseca (npr. 1.1. ali 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorska ločljivost:** ~40 metrov."

#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"The **Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics** is a monthly composite obtained by "
"computing the local resolution weighted average of radiometrically and "
"geometrically terrain corrected input scenes. Due to the use of all "
"available data in a month, it contains less speckle (temporal average) and "
"the best possible local resolution (combination of ascending and descending "
"orbits).\n"
"\n"
"The input for the Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics are scenes taken in the IW "
"acquisition mode with DV polarization.\n"
"\n"
"**Coverage:** Over land and coastal areas (mainly between 80°N and 56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Data availability:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"The data for each month is available in the catalog on the 1st day of the "
"corresponding month (e.g. 1.1. or 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Spatial Resolution:** ~20 meters."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek **Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics** je mesečni kompozit, pridobljen z "
"izračunom povprečja vhodnih prizorov, radiometrično in geometrično "
"popravljenih glede na teren, ki je tehtano z lokalno ločljivostjo. Ker "
"uporablja vse razpoložljive podatke v mesecu, vsebuje manj šuma »speckle« "
"(časovno povprečje) in najboljšo možno lokalno ločljivost (kombinacija "
"naraščajočih in padajočih orbit).\n"
"\n"
"Vhodni podatki za Sentinel-1 IW Monthly Mosaics so prizori, posneti v "
"načinu zajema IW s polarizacijo DV.\n"
"\n"
"**Pokritost:** Nad kopnim in obalnimi območji (predvsem med 80°N in 56°S)\n"
"\n"
"**Razpoložljivost podatkov:** ${ displayRange }\n"
"\n"
"Podatki za posamezen mesec so v katalogu na voljo na 1. dan ustreznega "
"meseca (npr. 1.1. ali 1.2.).\n"
"\n"
"**Prostorska ločljivost:** ~20 metrov."

msgid "Select a data source or enter search criteria to see results."
msgstr "Izberite vir podatkov ali vnesite iskalne kriterije za prikaz rezultatov."

msgid "CPFLD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"
msgstr "CPFLD 10m Yearly (2017–present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land Duration (CPFLD) "
"raster product provides information on the duration of fallow land periods, "
"expressed in days, over a five-year period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"Note: each product covers a five-year window and is referenced by the end "
"year of that window (e.g. the 2021 product covers the period 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Fallow Land "
"Duration (CPFLD) zagotavlja informacije o trajanju obdobij prahe, izraženem "
"v dneh, v petletnem obdobju.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Opomba: vsak izdelek pokriva petletno okno in je označen s končnim letom "
"tega okna (npr. izdelek 2021 pokriva obdobje 2017–2021).\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid ""
"Classification of the Sentinel-2 image using the MAJA cloud screening and "
"atmospheric correction software, developed by CNES and CESBIO with "
"contributions from DLR. Cloud detection is performed at a spatial "
"resolution of 120 m."
msgstr ""
"Klasifikacija posnetka Sentinel-2 z uporabo programske opreme MAJA za "
"zaznavanje oblakov in atmosferski popravek, ki sta jo razvila CNES in "
"CESBIO s prispevki DLR. Zaznavanje oblakov poteka s prostorsko ločljivostjo "
"120 m."

msgid ""
"Quality layer providing basic assessment of the cloud and cloud shadow "
"classification layer."
msgstr ""
"Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno klasifikacijskega sloja oblakov "
"in senc oblakov."

msgid ""
"Bitmask layer with pixel quality flags. The default visualisation "
"highlights pixels where clouds have been detected using a single-scene, "
"threshold-based approach. These correspond to pixels where bit 0 is "
"activated. Additional information can also be visualised by selecting other "
"bits. More details are available in the </> Custom option."
msgstr ""
"Sloj bitne maske z zastavicami kakovosti pikslov. Privzeti prikaz poudari "
"piksle, kjer so bili oblaki zaznani z enoprizornim pristopom na podlagi "
"pragov. Ti ustrezajo pikslom, kjer je aktiviran bit 0. Z izbiro drugih "
"bitov je mogoče prikazati tudi dodatne informacije. Več podrobnosti je na "
"voljo v možnosti </> Po meri."

msgid ""
"Fraction of the surface covered by snow (ranging from 0% to 100%). In the "
"presence of tree cover, estimate of the fraction of snow under the canopy. "
"The dataset has also the following classes: cloud or cloud shadow (205), "
"inland water (210), and no data (255)."
msgstr ""
"Delež površja, prekritega s snegom (od 0 % do 100 %). Ob prisotnosti "
"drevesnega pokrova je to ocena deleža snega pod krošnjami. Zbirka podatkov "
"ima tudi naslednje razrede: oblak ali senca oblaka (205), celinske vode "
"(210) in ni podatkov (255)."

msgid ""
"Quality layer providing basic assessment of the on-ground snow fraction "
"layer."
msgstr "Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno sloja deleža snega na tleh."

msgid ""
"Fraction of the surface covered by snow as seen above the top of the "
"canopy, i.e. visible from space (ranging from 0% to 100%). The dataset has "
"also the following classes: cloud or cloud shadow (205), inland water "
"(210), and no data (255)."
msgstr ""
"Delež površja, prekritega s snegom, kot je viden nad vrhom krošenj, tj. "
"viden iz vesolja (od 0 % do 100 %). Zbirka podatkov ima tudi naslednje "
"razrede: oblak ali senca oblaka (205), celinske vode (210) in ni podatkov "
"(255)."

msgid ""
"Quality layer providing basic assessment of the Top-of-canopy snow fraction "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno sloja deleža snega na vrhu "
"krošenj."

msgid ""
"Bitmask layer with pixel quality flags. The default visualisation displays "
"whether the pixel is located in the hillshade. These correspond to pixels "
"where bit 0 is activated. Additional information can also be visualised by "
"selecting other bits. More details are available in the </> Custom option."
msgstr ""
"Sloj bitne maske z zastavicami kakovosti pikslov. Privzeti prikaz kaže, ali "
"je piksel v reliefni senci. Ti ustrezajo pikslom, kjer je aktiviran bit 0. "
"Z izbiro drugih bitov je mogoče prikazati tudi dodatne informacije. Več "
"podrobnosti je na voljo v možnosti </> Po meri."

msgid ""
"Bitmask layer defining cloud and cloud-shadow masks derived from the input "
"MAJA Sentinel-2 Level-2A product. The default visualisation displays all "
"clouds except the thinnest ones, as well as all cloud shadows. These "
"correspond to pixels where bit 0 is activated. Additional information can "
"also be visualised by selecting other bits. More details are available in "
"the </> Custom option."
msgstr ""
"Sloj bitne maske, ki določa maski oblakov in senc oblakov, izpeljani iz "
"vhodnega izdelka MAJA Sentinel-2 Level-2A. Privzeti prikaz kaže vse oblake "
"razen najtanjših ter vse sence oblakov. Ti ustrezajo pikslom, kjer je "
"aktiviran bit 0. Z izbiro drugih bitov je mogoče prikazati tudi dodatne "
"informacije. Več podrobnosti je na voljo v možnosti </> Po meri."

msgid ""
"Values of the spectral index Normalized Difference Snow Index for "
"snow-covered-pixels (ranging from 0% to 100%). The index is derived from "
"the input MAJA Sentinel-2 level 2A product. The dataset has also the "
"following classes: cloud or cloud shadow (205), inland water (210), and no "
"data (255)."
msgstr ""
"Vrednosti spektralnega indeksa normaliziranega diferenčnega indeksa snega "
"za piksle, prekrite s snegom (od 0 % do 100 %). Indeks je izpeljan iz "
"vhodnega izdelka MAJA Sentinel-2 level 2A. Zbirka podatkov ima tudi "
"naslednje razrede: oblak ali senca oblaka (205), celinske vode (210) in ni "
"podatkov (255)."

msgid ""
"Wet Snow classification performed in high Mountains areas as described in "
"the documentation. The possible values are wet snow (110), and Dry snow or "
"snow-free or patchy snow (125). The dataset is also masked with the "
"following classes: radar Shadow, layover, or foreshortening (200), water "
"(210), forest (220), urban areas (230), non-mountain areas (240) and no "
"data (255)."
msgstr ""
"Klasifikacija mokrega snega, izvedena v visokogorskih območjih, kot je "
"opisano v dokumentaciji. Možne vrednosti so mokri sneg (110) ter suh sneg "
"ali brez snega ali krpast sneg (125). Zbirka podatkov je prav tako "
"maskirana z naslednjimi razredi: radarska senca, prekrivanje ali skrajšanje "
"(200), voda (210), gozd (220), urbana območja (230), nehribovita območja "
"(240) in ni podatkov (255)."

msgid ""
"Quality layer providing basic assessment of the wet snow classification "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno sloja klasifikacije mokrega "
"snega."

msgid ""
"Snow State Classification (SSC) within the Sentinel-2 snow cover map "
"derived from the CLMS FSC product - top-of canopy FSC layer (FSCTOC). It "
"provides binary discrimination of wet (110) and dry (115) snow and "
"identifies patchy snow or snow-free areas (120). The dataset has also the "
"following classes: radar shadow, layover, foreshortening (200), shadow, and "
"clouds and cloud shadow (205) from the aggregated FSCTOC layer, water "
"(210), forest (220), urban areas (230), and no data (255)."
msgstr ""
"Klasifikacija stanja snega (SSC) znotraj karte snežne odeje Sentinel-2, "
"izpeljane iz izdelka CLMS FSC – sloj FSC na vrhu krošenj (FSCTOC). "
"Zagotavlja binarno razlikovanje med mokrim (110) in suhim (115) snegom ter "
"prepoznava krpast sneg ali območja brez snega (120). Zbirka podatkov ima "
"tudi naslednje razrede: radarska senca, prekrivanje, skrajšanje (200), "
"senca ter oblaki in sence oblakov (205) iz združenega sloja FSCTOC, voda "
"(210), gozd (220), urbana območja (230) in ni podatkov (255)."

msgid ""
"Quality layer providing basic assessment of the wet snow state "
"classification."
msgstr ""
"Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno klasifikacije stanja mokrega "
"snega."

msgid "Sentinel-2 CC Europe 20m Daily V1"
msgstr "Sentinel-2 CC Europe 20m Daily V1"

msgid "FSC Europe 20m Daily V2"
msgstr "FSC Europe 20m Daily V2"

msgid "SWS Europe (high mountains) 60m Daily V2"
msgstr "SWS Europe (high mountains) 60m Daily V2"

msgid "WDS Europe 60m Daily V2"
msgstr "WDS Europe 60m Daily V2"

msgid ""
"Fraction of the surface covered by snow (ranging from 0% to 100%). The "
"dataset has also the following classes: cloud or cloud shadow (205), inland "
"water (210), and no data (255)."
msgstr ""
"Delež površja, prekritega s snegom (od 0 % do 100 %). Zbirka podatkov ima "
"tudi naslednje razrede: oblak ali senca oblaka (205), celinske vode (210) "
"in ni podatkov (255)."

msgid ""
"Quality layer providing basic assessment of the snow fraction GF layer. For "
"pixels with a QAFLAGS bit 7 value of 0, the data quality refers to the "
"Sentinel-2 optical snow data quality. For pixels with a QAFLAGS bit 7 value "
"of 1, the data quality refers to the Sentinel-1 SAR wet snow data quality."
msgstr ""
"Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno sloja deleža snega GF. Za "
"piksle z vrednostjo bita 7 v QAFLAGS 0 se kakovost podatkov nanaša na "
"kakovost optičnih podatkov o snegu Sentinel-2. Za piksle z vrednostjo bita "
"7 v QAFLAGS 1 se kakovost podatkov nanaša na kakovost podatkov SAR o mokrem "
"snegu Sentinel-1."

msgid "Number of days of snow cover over the hydrological year."
msgstr "Število dni snežne odeje v hidrološkem letu."

msgid ""
"Snow cover onset date, expressed as the number of days from the beginning "
"of the hydrological year (1st September = day 0). Note that SCO is not "
"given when the snow cover duration SCD is less than 60 days."
msgstr ""
"Datum začetka snežne odeje, izražen kot število dni od začetka hidrološkega "
"leta (1. september = dan 0). Upoštevajte, da SCO ni podan, kadar je "
"trajanje snežne odeje SCD krajše od 60 dni."

msgid ""
"Snow cover melt out date, expressed as the number of days from the "
"beginning of the hydrological year (1st September = day 0). Note that SCM "
"is not given when the snow cover duration SCD is less than 60 days."
msgstr ""
"Datum konca taljenja snežne odeje, izražen kot število dni od začetka "
"hidrološkega leta (1. september = dan 0). Upoštevajte, da SCM ni podan, "
"kadar je trajanje snežne odeje SCD krajše od 60 dni."

msgid ""
"Number of days with clear sky observations used in the interpolation of the "
"snow cover time series within the hydrological year."
msgstr ""
"Število dni z opazovanji ob jasnem nebu, uporabljenih pri interpolaciji "
"časovne serije snežne odeje znotraj hidrološkega leta."

msgid ""
"Bitmask layer with pixel quality flags. The default visualisation displays "
"areas where the snow cover duration is less than 60 days. These correspond "
"to pixels where bit 4 is activated. Additional information can also be "
"visualised by selecting other bits. More details are available in the </> "
"Custom option."
msgstr ""
"Sloj bitne maske z zastavicami kakovosti pikslov. Privzeti prikaz kaže "
"območja, kjer je trajanje snežne odeje krajše od 60 dni. Ta ustrezajo "
"pikslom, kjer je aktiviran bit 4. Z izbiro drugih bitov je mogoče prikazati "
"tudi dodatne informacije. Več podrobnosti je na voljo v možnosti </> Po "
"meri."

msgid "Quality layer providing a basic assessment of the snow cover duration layer."
msgstr "Sloj kakovosti, ki zagotavlja osnovno oceno sloja trajanja snežne odeje."

msgid ""
"Number of days between the estimated snow onset date and the closest snow "
"observation date."
msgstr ""
"Število dni med ocenjenim datumom začetka snega in najbližjim datumom "
"opazovanja snega."

msgid ""
"Number of days between the estimated snow melt out date and the closest "
"snow observation date."
msgstr ""
"Število dni med ocenjenim datumom konca taljenja snega in najbližjim "
"datumom opazovanja snega."

msgid ""
"Number of days with Sentinel-1-based wet snow observations used in the "
"interpolation of the snow cover time series within the hydrological year "
"(used where Sentinel-2-based observations have gaps)."
msgstr ""
"Število dni z opazovanji mokrega snega na podlagi Sentinel-1, uporabljenih "
"pri interpolaciji časovne serije snežne odeje znotraj hidrološkega leta "
"(uporabljeno, kjer imajo opazovanja na podlagi Sentinel-2 vrzeli)."

msgid "GFSC Europe 60m Daily V1"
msgstr "GFSC Europe 60m Daily V1"

msgid "SP S2 Europe 20m Yearly V1"
msgstr "SP S2 Europe 20m Yearly V1"

msgid "SP S1+S2 Europe (high mountains) 60m Yearly V1"
msgstr "SP S1+S2 Europe (high mountains) 60m Yearly V1"

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 100m "
"information on the broadleaved cover density."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o gostoti pokrova listavcev na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 m."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 100 m the "
"percentage of grassland coverage within each 100 m cell."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja odstotek pokritosti s travinjem znotraj posamezne celice 100 m "
"na vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 m."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 100 m the level "
"of tree cover density in a range from 0% to 100%."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja raven gostote drevesnega pokrova v razponu od 0 % do 100 % na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 m."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the emergence date of the main growing "
"season at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja datum vznika glavne rastne sezone na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for main crop emergence."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za vznik glavnega posevka."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level the harvest date of the main growing season "
"at a spatial resolution of 10 m and a MMU of 0.25 ha."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja datum žetve glavne rastne sezone na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 10 m in MMU 0,25 ha."

msgid "Confidence layer - a quality indicator for main crop harvest."
msgstr "Sloj zaupanja – kazalnik kakovosti za žetev glavnega posevka."

msgid "BCD 100m Yearly (2018-present)"
msgstr "BCD 100m Yearly (2018-present)"

msgid "GRA 100m Yearly (2017-present)"
msgstr "GRA 100m Yearly (2017-present)"

msgid "TCD 100m Yearly (2018-present)"
msgstr "TCD 100m Yearly (2018-present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of broadleaved pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of broadleaved "
"pixels are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the "
"BCD. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Zbirka podatkov High Resolution Layer Broadleaved Density (BCD) zagotavlja "
"informacije o odstotku pikslov listavcev s prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 m in "
"je izpeljana z agregacijo DLT ločljivosti 10 m za zadevno referenčno leto. "
"Znotraj vsake celice se prešteje število pikslov listavcev, odstotki pa se "
"shranijo v piksel BCD ločljivosti 100 m. Razred 255 = zunanje območje je "
"vnaprej določen s slojem meje ločljivosti 100 m in ostaja nespremenjen.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2018 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 100 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) dataset provides the Forest "
"Type estimation at 100 meter spatial resolution. The number of broadleaved "
"and coniferous pixels are counted and the percentages stored in the 100m "
"cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer "
"and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided on a 3-yearly frequency in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Zbirka podatkov High Resolution Layer Forest Type (FTY) zagotavlja oceno "
"tipa gozda s prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 metrov. Prešteje se število "
"pikslov listavcev in iglavcev, odstotki pa se shranijo v celico 100 m. "
"Razred 255 = zunanje območje je vnaprej določen s slojem meje ločljivosti "
"100 m in ostaja nespremenjen.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo s triletno pogostostjo v rastrih ločljivosti "
"100 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v ploščicah 100 x "
"100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) raster product provides a binary "
"status layer of grassland/non-grassland mask. This grassy and non-woody "
"vegetation baseline product includes all kinds of grasslands: managed "
"grassland, semi-natural grassland and natural grassy vegetation. It does "
"not include temporary grasslands, which are masked out using the "
"corresponding Ploughing indicator (PLOUGH), indicating on the number of "
"years since a pixel was last ploughed. In the 100 meter raster product, the "
"number of Grassland pixels are counted and the percentages stored in each "
"100 meter cell. The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m "
"boundary layer and remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Grassland (GRA) zagotavlja binarni "
"statusni sloj maske travinje/ne travinje. Ta osnovni izdelek travnate in "
"neolesenele vegetacije vključuje vse vrste travinja: gospodarjeno travinje, "
"polnaravno travinje in naravno travnato vegetacijo. Ne vključuje začasnega "
"travinja, ki je izločeno z ustreznim indikatorjem oranja (PLOUGH), ki kaže "
"število let od zadnjega oranja piksla. V rastrskem izdelku ločljivosti 100 "
"metrov se prešteje število pikslov travinja, odstotki pa se shranijo v "
"vsako celico 100 metrov. Razred 255 = zunanje območje je vnaprej določen s "
"slojem meje ločljivosti 100 m in ostaja nespremenjen.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 100 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) dataset provides "
"information on the proportional crown coverage per pixel at 100 meter "
"spatial resolution and ranges from 0% (all non-tree covered areas) to 100%, "
"whereby Tree Cover Density is defined as the \"vertical projection of tree "
"crowns to a horizontal earth's surface\". This product is an aggregation of "
"its corresponding high resolution dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Zbirka podatkov High Resolution Layer Tree Cover Density (TCD) zagotavlja "
"informacije o sorazmerni pokritosti s krošnjami na piksel s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 100 metrov in sega od 0 % (vsa območja brez drevesnega "
"pokrova) do 100 %, pri čemer je gostota drevesnega pokrova definirana kot "
"»navpična projekcija krošenj dreves na vodoravno zemeljsko površje«. Ta "
"izdelek je agregacija ustrezne zbirke podatkov visoke ločljivosti.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2018 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 100 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop Emergence (CPMCE) "
"raster product provides the emergence date of the main (annual) crop "
"expressed in DOY (day of year). YYDOY where YY = last 2 digits of the year "
"(e.g. 19 for 2019) and DOY is the day of the year (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting in 2017 with 10 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Croplands product is part of the European Union's "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Cropping Patterns - Main Crop "
"Emergence (CPMCE) zagotavlja datum vznika glavnega (enoletnega) posevka, "
"izražen v DOY (dan v letu). YYDOY, kjer je YY = zadnji dve števki leta "
"(npr. 19 za 2019), DOY pa je dan v letu (1-365).\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2017 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 10 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Croplands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"croplands)."

msgid "Sticker"
msgstr "Nalepka"

msgid "Switch between a light or dark logo overlay on the exported image."
msgstr "Preklopite med svetlim ali temnim prekrivnim logotipom na izvoženi sliki."

msgid "Dark overlay"
msgstr "Temen prekrivni sloj"

#, javascript-format
msgid "AOI area exceeds the maximum allowed area of ${ v } km²"
msgstr "Površina AOI presega največjo dovoljeno površino ${ v } km²"

#, javascript-format
msgid "AOI height exceeds the maximum allowed height of ${ v } km"
msgstr "Višina AOI presega največjo dovoljeno višino ${ v } km"

#, javascript-format
