msgstr "Širina AOI presega največjo dovoljeno širino ${ v } km"

msgid ""
"The Normalized Difference Vegetation Index is a spectral index indicating "
"the greenness of the vegetation."
msgstr ""
"Normaliziran diferenčni vegetacijski indeks je spektralni indeks, ki kaže "
"zelenost vegetacije."

msgid ""
"Number of clear-sky surface reflectance used for the inversion of the "
"bidirectional reflectance distribution function."
msgstr ""
"Število odbojnosti površja ob jasnem nebu, uporabljenih za inverzijo "
"dvosmerne porazdelitvene funkcije odbojnosti."

msgid ""
"Uncertainty of the NDVI is calculated by propagating the uncertainties "
"associated to the model parameters resulting from the inversion of the "
"bidirectional reflectance distribution function."
msgstr ""
"Negotovost NDVI se izračuna s propagacijo negotovosti, povezanih s "
"parametri modela, ki izhajajo iz inverzije dvosmerne porazdelitvene "
"funkcije odbojnosti."

msgid ""
"Maximum value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Največja vrednost normaliziranega diferenčnega vegetacijskega indeksa, "
"izračunana v 21-letnem obdobju 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Mean value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Povprečna vrednost normaliziranega diferenčnega vegetacijskega indeksa, "
"izračunana v 21-letnem obdobju 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Median value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Mediana normaliziranega diferenčnega vegetacijskega indeksa, izračunana v "
"21-letnem obdobju 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Minimum value of the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index calculated over "
"the 21-years period 1999-2019."
msgstr ""
"Najmanjša vrednost normaliziranega diferenčnega vegetacijskega indeksa, "
"izračunana v 21-letnem obdobju 1999-2019."

msgid ""
"Uncertainty of the NDVI is calculated by error propagation of the "
"uncertainty associated to input spectral surface reflectances."
msgstr ""
"Negotovost NDVI se izračuna s propagacijo napake negotovosti, povezane z "
"vhodnimi spektralnimi odbojnostmi površja."

msgid ""
"Number of clear-sky surface reflectance in the dekad time window, minimum "
"over the spectral bands used for the NDVI calculation."
msgstr ""
"Število odbojnosti površja ob jasnem nebu v dekadnem časovnem oknu, "
"najmanjše med spektralnimi kanali, uporabljenimi za izračun NDVI."

msgid ""
"Provides the Long-Term Statistics of the Normalized Difference Vegetation "
"Index. Every 10-days, minimum, median, maximum and mean are available at "
"global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~1km over the 21-years period "
"1999-2019. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-long-term-statistics-v3-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja dolgoročno statistiko normaliziranega diferenčnega "
"vegetacijskega indeksa. Vsakih 10 dni so na voljo najmanjša vrednost, "
"mediana, največja vrednost in povprečje v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~1 km za 21-letno obdobje 1999-2019. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-long-term-statistics-v3-0-1km)."

msgid ""
"Provides information on the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a "
"spectral index quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300m. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v2-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o normaliziranem diferenčnem vegetacijskem indeksu, "
"spektralnem indeksu, ki kvantificira količino in vitalnost vegetacije. "
"Vsakih 10 dni so ocene na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~300 m. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v2-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides information on the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a "
"spectral index quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every "
"10-days, estimates are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution "
"of ~300m. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-300m)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o normaliziranem diferenčnem vegetacijskem indeksu, "
"spektralnem indeksu, ki kvantificira količino in vitalnost vegetacije. "
"Vsakih 10 dni so ocene na voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo ~300 m. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-300m)."

msgid ""
"Provides the Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, a spectral index "
"quantifying the amount and vigour of vegetation. Every 10-days, estimates "
"are available at global scale, at a spatial resolution of ~1km from January "
"1999 to June 2020. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja normaliziran diferenčni vegetacijski indeks, spektralni indeks, "
"ki kvantificira količino in vitalnost vegetacije. Vsakih 10 dni so ocene na "
"voljo v globalnem merilu s prostorsko ločljivostjo ~1 km od januarja 1999 "
"do junija 2020. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/vegetation/normalised-"
"difference-vegetation-index-v3-0-1km)."

msgid "Projection name"
msgstr "Ime projekcije"

msgid "Tree Cover Density expressed as percentage of tree cover at 10 m resolution."
msgstr ""
"Gostota drevesnega pokrova, izražena kot odstotek drevesnega pokrova pri "
"ločljivosti 10 m."

msgid ""
"Provides yearly tree cover density for the pantropical region at 10 m "
"resolution, expressed as percentage of tree cover. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja letno gostoto drevesnega pokrova za pantropsko regijo pri "
"ločljivosti 10 m, izraženo kot odstotek drevesnega pokrova. Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/global-dynamic-land-cover/"
"tree-cover-density-2020-raster-10-m-pantropical-annual)."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 100 m "
"information on the coniferous cover density."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o gostoti pokrova iglavcev na vseevropski ravni s "
"prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 m."

msgid "CCD 100m Yearly (2018-present)"
msgstr "CCD 100m Yearly (2018-present)"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) dataset provides "
"information on the percentage of coniferous pixels at 100m spatial "
"resolution, and is derived through aggregation of the 10m DLT for the "
"respective reference year. Within each cell the number of coniferous pixels "
"are counted and the percentages stored into in the 100m pixel of the CCD. "
"The class 255 = outside area is predefined by the 100m boundary layer and "
"remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided annually starting with 2018 in 100 meter rasters "
"(fully conformant with the EEA reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles "
"covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest product is part of the European "
"Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-forests-"
"and-tree-cover)."
msgstr ""
"Zbirka podatkov High Resolution Layer Coniferous Cover Density (CCD) "
"zagotavlja informacije o odstotku pikslov iglavcev s prostorsko "
"ločljivostjo 100 m in je izpeljana z agregacijo DLT ločljivosti 10 m za "
"zadevno referenčno leto. Znotraj vsake celice se prešteje število pikslov "
"iglavcev, odstotki pa se shranijo v piksel CCD ločljivosti 100 m. Razred "
"255 = zunanje območje je vnaprej določen s slojem meje ločljivosti 100 m in "
"ostaja nespremenjen.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo letno od leta 2018 naprej v rastrih "
"ločljivosti 100 metrov (popolnoma skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v "
"ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Tree Cover and Forest je del storitve "
"Copernicus za spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"forests-and-tree-cover)."

