msgid ""
"Provides an annually updated, pan-European spatially consistent and "
"seamless geospatial proxy for the 6 main land use categories (and some "
"sub-categories) as reported for the LULUCF regulation (Land Use, Land Use "
"Change and Forestry) by the countries. Each pixel is corresponding to the 6 "
"main LULUCF land use categories but including sub-categories the product "
"has 27 classes. The dataset is available as a 100 m raster."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja letno posodobljen, vseevropsko prostorsko skladen in neprekinjen "
"geoprostorski približek za 6 glavnih kategorij rabe tal (in nekatere "
"podkategorije), kot jih države poročajo za uredbo LULUCF (raba zemljišč, "
"spremembe rabe zemljišč in gozdarstvo). Vsak piksel ustreza 6 glavnim "
"kategorijam rabe tal LULUCF, vendar ima izdelek z vključenimi "
"podkategorijami 27 razredov. Zbirka podatkov je na voljo kot raster 100 m."

msgid "CLCplus LULUCF Instance Europe 100m Yearly V1"
msgstr "CLCplus LULUCF Instance Europe 100m Yearly V1"

msgid ""
"This metadata refers to the CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), an annually "
"updated, pan-European, spatially consistent and seamless geospatial proxy "
"for land use reporting under the LULUCF regulation. The product is "
"delivered as a single raster layer with a spatial resolution of 100 m, "
"derived from multiple pan-European Copernicus Land Monitoring Service "
"(CLMS) high resolution input datasets. The LULUCF Instance is available for "
"the reference years 2018, 2021, 2022 and 2023, with production moving to an "
"annual update cycle starting from the 2021 product. Each raster cell "
"represents a dominant LULUCF land-use class, assigned according to thematic "
"and spatial rulesets implemented during the extraction process. While each "
"pixel corresponds primarily to one of the six main LULUCF land use "
"categories - forest land, grassland, cropland, settlements, wetlands, and "
"other lands - the dataset further differentiates these categories into sub "
"classes, resulting in a total of 27 classes. This classification structure "
"supports greenhouse gas reporting and other applications within the LULUCF "
"sector by providing a harmonised and policy relevant representation of land "
"use across Europe. More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."
msgstr ""
"Ti metapodatki se nanašajo na CORINE Land Cover Plus Land Use, Land-Use "
"Change and Forestry Instance (CLCplus LULUCF Instance), letno posodobljen, "
"vseevropski, prostorsko skladen in neprekinjen geoprostorski približek za "
"poročanje o rabi tal v okviru uredbe LULUCF. Izdelek je dostavljen kot en "
"sam rastrski sloj s prostorsko ločljivostjo 100 m, izpeljan iz več "
"vseevropskih vhodnih zbirk podatkov visoke ločljivosti storitve Copernicus "
"za spremljanje kopenskega površja (CLMS). LULUCF Instance je na voljo za "
"referenčna leta 2018, 2021, 2022 in 2023, pri čemer se izdelava od izdelka "
"2021 naprej preusmerja na letni cikel posodabljanja. Vsaka rastrska celica "
"predstavlja prevladujoči razred rabe tal LULUCF, dodeljen po tematskih in "
"prostorskih pravilih, uporabljenih pri postopku izločanja. Čeprav vsak "
"piksel ustreza predvsem eni od šestih glavnih kategorij rabe tal LULUCF – "
"gozdna zemljišča, travinje, njivske površine, naselja, mokrišča in druga "
"zemljišča – zbirka podatkov te kategorije dodatno razčleni na podrazrede, "
"kar skupaj da 27 razredov. Ta klasifikacijska struktura podpira poročanje o "
"toplogrednih plinih in druge uporabe v sektorju LULUCF, saj zagotavlja "
"usklajeno in za politike pomembno predstavitev rabe tal po vsej Evropi. Več "
"informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/clcplus-lulucf-instance)."

