msgid "Spectral explorer is not available in this panel."
msgstr "Spektralni raziskovalnik v tej plošči ni na voljo."

msgid "External WMS layers can't be included in a story and were skipped."
msgstr "Zunanjih slojev WMS ni mogoče vključiti v zgodbo, zato so bili preskočeni."

msgid "Please load a WMS layer first"
msgstr "Najprej naloži sloj WMS"

msgid "Map bounds are not available. Try again after the map has loaded."
msgstr "Meje karte niso na voljo. Poskusite znova, ko se karta naloži."

msgid ""
"Could not download this layer. The WMTS server may not support image "
"download."
msgstr ""
"Tega sloja ni bilo mogoče prenesti. Strežnik WMTS morda ne podpira prenosa "
"slik."

msgid "Failed to download image."
msgstr "Slike ni bilo mogoče prenesti."

msgid ""
"The **WMS/WMTS panel** lets you add third-party map layers to Copernicus "
"Browser via a service **GetCapabilities URL**.\n"
"\n"
"To **add a service** - paste its GetCapabilities URL into the input field "
"and click the add button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span> (or press Enter). The service and its layers appear "
"alongside the standard collections.\n"
"\n"
"Once a service is loaded, you can:\n"
"- View **service details** (description, access constraints and fees) - by "
"clicking on the info icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> next to the service name.\n"
"- **Select** a service - by clicking on its name; the active service is "
"marked with a checkmark and its layers are listed below.\n"
"- **Remove** a service - by clicking on the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"In the layer list you can **search** layers by name, page through them with "
"the <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> and "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> "
"controls, and pick how many layers to show per page. Click a layer to "
"display it on the map. On the active layer, use **Add to** <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> to add it to the "
"**Compare** or **Pins** panels."
msgstr ""
"**Plošča WMS/WMTS** vam omogoča dodajanje slojev kart tretjih oseb v "
"Copernicus Browser prek storitvenega **URL-ja GetCapabilities**.\n"
"\n"
"Za **dodajanje storitve** prilepite njen URL GetCapabilities v vnosno polje "
"in kliknite gumb za dodajanje <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span> (ali pritisnite Enter). Storitev in njeni sloji se "
"prikažejo ob standardnih zbirkah.\n"
"\n"
"Ko je storitev naložena, lahko:\n"
"- Si ogledate **podrobnosti storitve** (opis, omejitve dostopa in "
"pristojbine) – s klikom na ikono informacij <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> poleg imena storitve.\n"
"- **Izberete** storitev – s klikom na njeno ime; aktivna storitev je "
"označena s kljukico, njeni sloji pa so navedeni spodaj.\n"
"- **Odstranite** storitev – s klikom na ikono za odstranitev <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Na seznamu slojev lahko sloje **iščete** po imenu, listate po njih s "
"kontrolnikoma <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> in <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> ter izberete, koliko slojev naj se prikaže "
"na stran. Kliknite sloj, da ga prikažete na karti. Na aktivnem sloju "
"uporabite **Dodaj v** <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span>, da ga dodate v plošči **Primerjaj** ali **Oznake**."

#, javascript-format
msgid "${ filteredCount } of ${ totalCount } layers"
msgstr "${ filteredCount } od ${ totalCount } slojev"

#, javascript-format
msgid "${ totalCount } layers"
msgstr "${ totalCount } slojev"

msgid "Anonymous sign-in is taking longer than expected. Please try again."
msgstr "Anonimna prijava traja dlje od pričakovanega. Poskusite znova."

msgid "Anonymous sign-in failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Anonimna prijava ni uspela. Poskusi znova."

msgid " (Category)"
msgstr " (Kategorija)"

msgid ""
"In the **Visualise tab** you can:\n"
"- Search for a **Date**.\n"
"- Select a **Theme**.\n"
"- Choose a **Collection**.\n"
"- Select a **Visualisation Layer**.\n"
"\n"
"You can change the **Date** (type in or select it from the calendar) and "
"set the cloud coverage. You can choose between \n"
"single date, mosaic and time range: ![Single](icon) ![Mosaic](icon) ![Time "
"Range](icon).\n"
"\n"
"The **Configurations** dropdown offers you different preconfigured themes "
"and your own custom configured instances if\n"
"you are logged in. To create an instance, go to your [personal "
"dashboard](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/).\n"
"\n"
"You can select a desired data source in the **Data Collections**. You can "
"read explanations of the satellites by clicking \n"
"on the information icon next to the name of the data collection. Here you "
"can also switch between different panels: \n"
"![Layers](icon) Layers, ![Highlights](icon) Highlights, ![Compare "
"mode](icon) Compare mode and ![Pins](icon) Pins."
msgstr ""
"V **zavihku Prikaži** lahko:\n"
"- Poiščete **datum**.\n"
"- Izberete **temo**.\n"
"- Izberete **zbirko**.\n"
"- Izberete **sloj prikaza**.\n"
"\n"
"**Datum** lahko spremenite (vnesete ga ali izberete v koledarju) in "
"nastavite oblačnost. Izbirate lahko med \n"
"enim datumom, mozaikom in časovnim obsegom: ![Single](icon) ![Mosaic](icon) "
"![Time Range](icon).\n"
"\n"
"Padajoči meni **Konfiguracije** ponuja različne vnaprej pripravljene teme "
"in vaše lastne konfigurirane primerke, če\n"
"ste prijavljeni. Za ustvarjanje primerka obiščite svojo [osebno nadzorno "
"ploščo](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/).\n"
"\n"
"Želeni vir podatkov lahko izberete v razdelku **Zbirke podatkov**. Razlage "
"satelitov lahko preberete s klikom \n"
"na ikono informacij poleg imena zbirke podatkov. Tu lahko tudi preklapljate "
"med različnimi ploščami: \n"
"![Layers](icon) Sloji, ![Highlights](icon) Poudarki, ![Compare mode](icon) "
"Način primerjave in ![Pins](icon) Oznake."

msgid ""
"You can select different pre-installed or custom spectral band combinations "
"to visualise data for the selected result.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the common options:\n"
"- **True Color** - Visual interpretation of land cover\n"
"- **False Color** - Visual interpretation of vegetation\n"
"- **NDVI** - Vegetation index\n"
"- **Moisture index** - Moisture index\n"
"- **SWIR** - Shortwave-infrared index\n"
"- **NDWI** - Normalized Difference Water Index\n"
"- **NDSI** - Normalized Difference Snow Index\n"
"\n"
"Most visualisations are given a description and a legend, which you can "
"view by clicking on the expand sign ![expand](icon).\n"
"Each of the layers offers an option to add it to Compare or Pins by "
"clicking <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Add to</span>.\n"
"Based on your action, the Compare and Pins panels will include added layers "
"![compare-with-badge](icon) ![pins-with-badge](icon)\n"
"which you can further organise and analyse under each tab.\n"
"\n"
"Click on the **Custom visualisation** option to select custom band "
"combinations, index combinations or write your own classification script "
"for the\n"
"visualisation of data. You can also use custom scripts, which are stored "
"elsewhere, either on Google Drive, GitHub or in our\n"
"[Custom script repository](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/). Paste "
"the URL of the script into the text box in the advanced script editing "
"panel\n"
"and click Refresh. The custom script of preconfigured layers can be edited "
"by choosing the code icon ![code-icon](icon).\n"
"\n"
"You can select <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-sliders\"></i></span> "
"**Show effects and advanced options** like the sampling method, advanced "
"RGB effects or apply \n"
"contrast (gain) and luminance (gamma). To return to preconfigured layers, "
"click <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-paint-brush\"></i></span> "
"**Show visualisations**.\n"
"**Share** your visualisation on social media by clicking on the share icon "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-share-alt\"></i></span>."
msgstr ""
"Za prikaz podatkov izbranega rezultata lahko izberete različne vnaprej "
"nameščene ali lastne kombinacije spektralnih kanalov.\n"
"\n"
"Nekatere pogoste možnosti:\n"
"- **True Color** (prave barve) - vizualna interpretacija pokrovnosti tal\n"
"- **False Color** (lažne barve) - vizualna interpretacija vegetacije\n"
"- **NDVI** - vegetacijski indeks\n"
"- **Indeks vlažnosti** - indeks vlažnosti\n"
"- **SWIR** - kratkovalovni infrardeči indeks\n"
"- **NDWI** - normaliziran diferenčni vodni indeks\n"
"- **NDSI** - normaliziran diferenčni indeks snega\n"
"\n"
"Večina prikazov ima opis in legendo, ki si ju lahko ogledate s klikom na "
"znak za razširitev ![expand](icon).\n"
"Vsak od slojev ponuja možnost dodajanja med Primerjaj ali Oznake s klikom "
"na <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i> Dodaj v</span>.\n"
"Glede na vaše dejanje bosta plošči Primerjaj in Oznake vključevali dodane "
"sloje ![compare-with-badge](icon) ![pins-with-badge](icon),\n"
"ki jih lahko v posameznem zavihku nadalje urejate in analizirate.\n"
"\n"
"Kliknite možnost **Ustvari prikaz po meri**, da izberete kombinacije "
"kanalov po meri, kombinacije indeksov ali napišete lastno klasifikacijsko "
"skripto za\n"
"prikaz podatkov. Uporabite lahko tudi skripte po meri, shranjene drugje, na "
"Google Drive, GitHubu ali v našem\n"
"[repozitoriju skript po meri](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/). "
"Prilepite URL skripte v besedilno polje v plošči za napredno urejanje "
"skriptov\n"
"in kliknite Osveži. Skripto po meri vnaprej konfiguriranih slojev lahko "
"urejate z izbiro ikone kode ![code-icon](icon).\n"
"\n"
"Izberete lahko <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-sliders\"></i></span> "
"**Pokaži učinke in napredne možnosti**, kot so način vzorčenja, napredni "
"učinki RGB ali uporaba \n"
"kontrasta (gain) in svetlosti (gamma). Za vrnitev na vnaprej konfigurirane "
"sloje kliknite <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-paint-brush\"></i></span> **Prikaži vizualizacije**.\n"
"**Delite** svoj prikaz na družbenih omrežjih s klikom na ikono za deljenje "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-share-alt\"></i></span>."

msgid ""
"If you choose one of the preconfigured themes under **Configurations**, you "
"will be able to select from a highlights list under the Highlights panel.\n"
"\n"
"Each highlight has a description accessible under the dropdown icon "
"![expand-description](icon)."
msgstr ""
"Če pod **Konfiguracije** izberete eno od vnaprej konfiguriranih tem, boste "
"lahko izbirali s seznama poudarkov v plošči Poudarki.\n"
"\n"
"Vsak poudarek ima opis, dostopen pod ikono spustnega menija "
"![expand-description](icon)."

msgid ""
"The **Pins** panel contains your pinned (favourite/saved) items. Pinned "
"items contain information about location, data source \n"
"and its specific layer, zoom level and time. To reorder the pins, choose "
"among the options in the **Order by** dropdown.\n"
"\n"
"You have several ways to interact with each pin:\n"
"- Change **order** - by clicking on the move icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i><i class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i></span> \n"
"in the top left corner of the pin and dragging the pin up or down the list.\n"
"- **Rename** - by clicking on the pencil icon ![rename](icon) next to the "
"pin's name.\n"
"- Add to the **Compare** panel - by clicking on the compare icon "
"![compare](icon).\n"
"- Enter a **description** - by clicking on the expand icon ![expand](icon).\n"
"- **Remove** - by clicking the remove icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"- **Zoom** to the pin's location - by clicking on the Lat/Lon.\n"
"\n"
"In the line above your pins, you have different options that apply to all "
"pins:\n"
"- Create your own story from pins - by clicking on **Story**.\n"
"- Share your pins with others via a link - by clicking on **Share**.\n"
"- Export pins as a JSON file - by clicking on **Export**.\n"
"- Import pins from a JSON file - by clicking on **Import**.\n"
"- Delete all pins - by clicking on **Clear**."
msgstr ""
"Plošča **Oznake** vsebuje vaše pripete (priljubljene/shranjene) elemente. "
"Pripeti elementi vsebujejo informacije o lokaciji, viru podatkov \n"
"in njegovem specifičnem sloju, ravni povečave in času. Za spremembo "
"vrstnega reda oznak izberite med možnostmi v spustnem meniju **Razvrsti "
"po**.\n"
"\n"
"Z vsako oznako lahko ravnate na več načinov:\n"
"- Spremenite **vrstni red** - s klikom na ikono za premik <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-ellipsis-v\"></i><i class=\"fa "
"fa-ellipsis-v\"></i></span> \n"
"v zgornjem levem kotu oznake in vlečenjem oznake navzgor ali navzdol po "
"seznamu.\n"
"- **Preimenujete** - s klikom na ikono svinčnika ![rename](icon) poleg "
"imena oznake.\n"
"- Dodate v ploščo **Primerjaj** - s klikom na ikono za primerjavo "
"![compare](icon).\n"
"- Vnesete **opis** - s klikom na ikono za razširitev ![expand](icon).\n"
"- **Odstranite** - s klikom na ikono za odstranitev <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"- **Povečate** na lokacijo oznake - s klikom na Lat/Lon.\n"
"\n"
"V vrstici nad oznakami imate različne možnosti, ki veljajo za vse oznake:\n"
"- Ustvarite lastno zgodbo iz oznak - s klikom na **Zgodba**.\n"
"- Delite oznake z drugimi prek povezave - s klikom na **Deli**.\n"
"- Izvozite oznake kot datoteko JSON - s klikom na **Izvozi**.\n"
"- Uvozite oznake iz datoteke JSON - s klikom na **Uvozi**.\n"
"- Izbrišete vse oznake - s klikom na **Počisti**."

msgid ""
"Under **Search** you can set:\n"
"- **Search criteria** by a product name.\n"
"- Choose from which **data sources** you want to receive the data by "
"selecting checkboxes. Where applicable, you can also set **filters**\n"
"such as satellite platform, orbit direction, relative orbit, number, "
"acquisition mode, product availability, timeliness, etc.\n"
"- Select the **time range** by either typing the date or selecting it from "
"the calendar. If you want to omit some of the months, enable\n"
"the **Filter by months** option and uncheck the non-relevant months.\n"
"\n"
"Once you hit Search you get a list of results. Each result is presented "
"with a preview image and relevant data specific to the data source.\n"
"For **product info** and **zooming to product**, click on the <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i></span> and <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-crosshairs\"></i></span> icons.\n"
"If you are logged in, you can click on ![workspace-add](icon) to **add a "
"product to your Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem Workspace**\n"
"to easily collect and process your satellite data. You can also **download "
"the product** by clicking on the download icon <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-download\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Clicking on the Visualise button will open the **Visualise** tab for the "
"selected result."
msgstr ""
"Pod **Iskanje** lahko nastavite:\n"
"- **Iskalne kriterije** po imenu izdelka.\n"
"- Izberite, iz katerih **virov podatkov** želite prejeti podatke, z izbiro "
"potrditvenih polj. Kjer je primerno, lahko nastavite tudi **filtre**,\n"
"kot so satelitska platforma, smer orbite, relativna orbita, številka, način "
"zajema, razpoložljivost izdelka, pravočasnost itd.\n"
"- Izberite **časovni obseg** z vnosom datuma ali izbiro v koledarju. Če "
"želite izpustiti nekatere mesece, omogočite\n"
"možnost **Filtriranje po mesecih** in odznačite nepomembne mesece.\n"
"\n"
"Ko kliknete Iskanje, dobite seznam rezultatov. Vsak rezultat je "
"predstavljen s predogledno sliko in ustreznimi podatki, specifičnimi za vir "
"podatkov.\n"
"Za **informacije o izdelku** in **povečavo na izdelek** kliknite ikoni "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-info-circle\"></i></span> in <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-crosshairs\"></i></span>.\n"
"Če ste prijavljeni, lahko kliknete ![workspace-add](icon), da **izdelek "
"dodate v svoj delovni prostor Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem**\n"
"za preprosto zbiranje in obdelavo satelitskih podatkov. **Izdelek** lahko "
"tudi **prenesete** s klikom na ikono za prenos <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-download\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"S klikom na gumb Prikaži se za izbrani rezultat odpre zavihek **Prikaži**."

msgid ""
"With this tool, you can download an image of visualised data for the "
"displayed location. You can choose to show \n"
"captions and you can add your own description. By enabling Analytical mode, "
"you can choose between various image formats, \n"
"image resolutions and coordinate systems. You can also select multiple "
"layers and download them as a <code>.zip</code> file.\n"
"\n"
"Click the download button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-download\"></i> Download</span> and your image(s) will \n"
"begin to download. The process can take a few seconds, depending on the "
"selected resolution and the number of selected layers.\n"
"\n"
"Before downloading, you can define an area of interest (AOI) by clicking on "
"the Area selection tool icon ![selection](icon).\n"
"Your data will be clipped to match this area."
msgstr ""
"S tem orodjem lahko prenesete sliko prikazanih podatkov za prikazano "
"lokacijo. Izberete lahko prikaz \n"
"podnapisov in dodate lasten opis. Z omogočitvijo analitičnega načina lahko "
"izbirate med različnimi oblikami slik, \n"
"ločljivostmi slik in koordinatnimi sistemi. Izberete lahko tudi več slojev "
"in jih prenesete kot datoteko <code>.zip</code>.\n"
"\n"
"Kliknite gumb za prenos <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-download\"></i> Prenesi</span> in prenos vaših slik se bo \n"
"začel. Postopek lahko traja nekaj sekund, odvisno od izbrane ločljivosti in "
"števila izbranih slojev.\n"
"\n"
"Pred prenosom lahko določite območje interesa (AOI) s klikom na ikono "
"orodja za izbiro območja ![selection](icon).\n"
"Vaši podatki bodo obrezani na to območje."

#. jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid
msgid "Define Area of Interest (AOI)"
msgstr "Določi območje interesa (AOI)"

msgid "Could not parse the WKT geometry."
msgstr "Geometrije WKT ni bilo mogoče razčleniti."

msgid "Could not parse the GeoJSON geometry."
msgstr "Geometrije GeoJSON ni bilo mogoče razčleniti."

msgid "Enter a valid MGRS or GEOREF reference."
msgstr "Vnesite veljavno referenco MGRS ali GEOREF."

msgid "Enter four numeric values for minX, minY, maxX and maxY."
msgstr "Vnesite štiri številske vrednosti za minX, minY, maxX in maxY."

msgid "minX must be less than maxX, and minY must be less than maxY."
msgstr "minX mora biti manjši od maxX, minY pa manjši od maxY."

msgid "File"
msgstr "Datoteka"

msgid "GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON"

msgid "WKT"
msgstr "WKT"

msgid "Bounding box"
msgstr "Omejevalni okvir"

msgid "Grid reference"
msgstr "Mrežna referenca"

msgid "Define Line of Interest (LOI)"
msgstr "Določi linijo interesa (LOI)"

