msgid "Uploading"
msgstr "Nalaganje"

msgid ""
"# Wildfires\n"
"\n"
"This script, based on the Pierre Markuse wildfire script, detects and "
"visualizes wildfires using Landsat 8/9 thermal and visible bands. It "
"combines natural color (B2, B3, B4) with thermal band (B10) analysis to "
"detect temperature anomalies and create a red-orange-white glow effect "
"highlighting fire locations.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://github.com/azlinszkysinergise/customscripts_test_az/blob/"
"main/landsat_markuse_fire_v2)"
msgstr ""
"# Požari v naravi\n"
"\n"
"Ta skripta, ki temelji na skripti Pierra Markuseja za požare v naravi, "
"zaznava in vizualizira požare v naravi s termalnimi in vidnimi kanali "
"Landsat 8/9. Združuje naravne barve (B2, B3, B4) z analizo termalnega "
"kanala (B10) za zaznavanje temperaturnih anomalij in ustvarja "
"rdeče-oranžno-beli sijaj, ki poudari lokacije požarov.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj.](https://github.com/azlinszkysinergise/customscripts_test_az/blob/"
"main/landsat_markuse_fire_v2)"

msgid "Histogram is not available in this panel."
msgstr "Histogram v tej plošči ni na voljo."

