"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Ponudnika posnetkov ni mogoče doseči. Preverite internetno povezavo in "
"poskusite znova."

msgid ""
"Provides at pan-European level in the spatial resolution of 20 m "
"information on changes in grassland vegetation cover."
msgstr ""
"Zagotavlja informacije o spremembah vegetacijskega pokrova travinja na "
"vseevropski ravni s prostorsko ločljivostjo 20 m."

msgid ""
"A **configuration** determines which collections, visualisation layers and "
"highlights are available to you.\n"
"\n"
"- **Configurations** are prepared by us and cover common use cases. Each "
"one comes with a curated list of collections that fit its purpose.\n"
"- **User configurations** are your own instances, created in your [personal "
"dashboard](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/). They are "
"available when you are logged in.\n"
"- **Highlights** are shown by default for our prepared configurations. They "
"are ready-made examples that let you start exploring without setting "
"anything up first."
msgstr ""
"**Konfiguracija** določa, katere zbirke, sloji prikaza in poudarki so vam "
"na voljo.\n"
"\n"
"- **Konfiguracije** pripravimo mi in pokrivajo pogoste primere uporabe. "
"Vsaka vključuje izbran seznam zbirk, ki ustrezajo njenemu namenu.\n"
"- **Uporabniške konfiguracije** so vaši lastni primerki, ustvarjeni v vaši "
"[osebni nadzorni "
"plošči](https://shapps.dataspace.copernicus.eu/dashboard/). Na voljo so, ko "
"ste prijavljeni.\n"
"- **Poudarki** so privzeto prikazani za naše pripravljene konfiguracije. So "
"že pripravljeni primeri, ki vam omogočajo, da začnete raziskovati, ne da bi "
"morali prej karkoli nastavljati."

msgid "DLTC 20m 3-yearly"
msgstr "DLTC 20m 3-yearly"

msgid "TCPC 20m 3-yearly"
msgstr "TCPC 20m 3-yearly"

msgid "GRAC 20m 3-yearly"
msgstr "GRAC 20m 3-yearly"

msgid ""
"The High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) raster product at 20m "
"resolution provides information on changes in grassland vegetation cover. "
"The thematic classes indicate all non-grassland areas, grassland gain and "
"grassland loss, unchanged grassland in both years and unverified grassland "
"gain and loss areas. This dataset covers two comparison periods, 2018-2021 "
"and 2021-2024, with each product dated by the end year of its comparison "
"period.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset is provided in 20 meter rasters (fully conformant with the EEA "
"reference grid) in 100 x 100 km tiles covering the EEA38 countries.\n"
"\n"
"High Resolution Layer Grasslands product is part of the European Union’s "
"Copernicus Land Monitoring Service. Confidence layer available for the "
"dataset.\n"
"\n"
"This dataset includes data from the French Overseas Territories (DOMs). "
"More information "
"[here](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."
msgstr ""
"Rastrski izdelek High Resolution Layer Grassland Change (GRAC) ločljivosti "
"20 m zagotavlja informacije o spremembah vegetacijskega pokrova travinja. "
"Tematski razredi kažejo vsa območja brez travinja, pridobitev in izgubo "
"travinja, nespremenjeno travinje v obeh letih ter nepreverjena območja "
"pridobitve in izgube travinja. Ta zbirka podatkov zajema dve primerjalni "
"obdobji, 2018-2021 in 2021-2024, pri čemer je vsak izdelek datiran s "
"končnim letom svojega primerjalnega obdobja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov je na voljo v rastrih ločljivosti 20 metrov (popolnoma "
"skladnih z referenčno mrežo EEA) v ploščicah 100 x 100 km, ki pokrivajo "
"države EEA38.\n"
"\n"
"Izdelek High Resolution Layer Grasslands je del storitve Copernicus za "
"spremljanje kopenskega površja Evropske unije. Za zbirko podatkov je na "
"voljo sloj zaupanja.\n"
"\n"
"Ta zbirka podatkov vključuje podatke francoskih čezmorskih ozemelj (DOM). "
"Več informacij "
"[tukaj](https://land.copernicus.eu/en/products/high-resolution-layer-"
"grasslands)."

msgid "Failed to load Google Maps. Please try again."
msgstr "Google Maps ni bilo mogoče naložiti. Poskusi znova."

msgid "Available layer styles"
msgstr "Razpoložljivi slogi slojev"

msgid ""
"Log in to unlock advanced features such as timelapse, analytical download, "
"and your own configurations."
msgstr ""
"S prijavo lahko odklenete napredne funkcije, kot so časovna animacija, "
"prenos analitičnih podatkov in lastne konfiguracije."

msgid "Use anonymously"
msgstr "Uporabi anonimno"

msgid ""
"By continuing anonymously, you consent to the use of cookies by "
"recaptcha.net and to its collection, sharing, and use of personal data. See "
"also [Terms and "
"conditions](https://dataspace.copernicus.eu/terms-and-conditions)"
